me, smart chip control, zero transition.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SKE","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":39306008461389,"sku":"","price":18.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid_Plus_1618659125380.jpg?v=1687052493"},{"product_id":"havit-tw925-wireless-stereo-earbuds","title":"Havit TW925 Wireless Stereo EARBUDS","description":"\u003cdiv id=\"main\" class=\"main\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"layout-container sc-pushing\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"layout\" class=\"layout sec_product_details_full\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"main-container\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"content\" class=\"shopping-layout-content\" data-pushing=\"product-details-information-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"ProductDetails.Full.View\" class=\"view product-detail focused-form-view\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product-details-full\"\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"product-details-full-content\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/Product\"\u003e\n\u003csection class=\"product-details-full-main-content\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product-details-full-main-content-right\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product-details-full-main\"\u003e\n\u003csection data-view=\"Product.Information\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product-details-information-content\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product-details-information-content-container\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv role=\"tabpanel\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product-details-information-tab-content\" data-type=\"information-content\" data-action=\"tab-content\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"product-details-information-tab-content-panel active\" id=\"product-details-information-tab-0\" itemprop=\"\" data-action=\"sc-pushing\" data-id=\"product-details-information-0\" data-pusher=\"sc-pushable-xs\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"product-details-information-tab-content-container-0\" class=\"product-details-information-tab-content-container\" data-type=\"information-content-text\"\u003eHAVIT TW925 True Wireless Earbuds give you the performance to explore beyond the limits of wires. Experience music anywhere, anytime with the latest Bluetooth® V 5.0 Wireless Technology and take your adventure to the next level. HAVIT TW925 PRO is a True Wireless Earbuds comfortable design with Built-in Mic, speaker frequency of 20HZ-20KHZ, more convenient box, and easy storage. The TWS95 earbuds have no master slave restrictions, when you are talking on calls or listening to music you can switch between single mode and bilateral mode without the loss of any sound channels. It can be carried anywhere without any burden on the ear and you will feel comfortable carrying it. Wireless Bluetooth® V 5.0 Technology and HD Sound quality - Advanced surround sound quality lets you enjoy high-fidelity sound quality with Bluetooth® chip: faster pairing speeds and a stable connection with Upto 35 ft\/10m Wireless Transmission Distance. Playtime Upto 3-3.5H (60% volume) and Talk time Upto 3 hours with Case, and Charging Case comes with 300 mAh battery capacity (Rechargeable). HAVIT TW925 Earbuds comes with Built-in Microphone and Rechargeable Battery iPhone \/ iPad \/ Android \/ Tablet \/ Sport \/ Office \/ Business \/ Workout. Portable rechargeable box with TYPE-C charging port, compact design, and easy to fit in pocket.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product-details-information-tab-content-container\" data-type=\"information-content-text\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"product-details-information-tab-content-panel \" id=\"product-details-information-tab-1\" itemprop=\"\" data-action=\"pushable\" data-id=\"product-details-information-1\" data-pusher=\"sc-pushable-xs\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"product-details-information-tab-content-container-1\" class=\"product-details-information-tab-content-container\" data-type=\"information-content-text\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-view=\"PDP.Specifications\"\u003e\n\u003ctable class=\"pdp-specifications-table\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd class=\"pdp-specifications-table-name\"\u003eCompatible Devices\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd class=\"pdp-specifications-table-value\"\u003eUniversal\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd class=\"pdp-specifications-table-name\"\u003eWeight\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd class=\"pdp-specifications-table-value\"\u003e6 oz\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd class=\"pdp-specifications-table-name\"\u003eProduct Category\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd class=\"pdp-specifications-table-value\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eHEADSETS\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eHAVIT\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd class=\"pdp-specifications-table-name\"\u003eProduct\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd class=\"pdp-specifications-table-value\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eBluetooth Headsets\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eHAVIT AUDIO\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"product-details-information-tab-content-panel \" id=\"product-details-information-tab-2\" itemprop=\"\" data-action=\"pushable\" data-id=\"product-details-information-2\" data-pusher=\"sc-pushable-xs\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"sc-pusher-header\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.balajiwireless.com\/havit-tw925-true-wireless-earbuds?color=1407#\" class=\"sc-pusher-header-back\" data-action=\"sc-pusher-dismiss\"\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"banner-details-bottom\" class=\"content-banner banner-details-bottom\" data-cms-area=\"item_details_banner_bottom\" data-cms-area-filters=\"page_type\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"cms-content cms-content-html\" id=\"cms-content-554-282\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"prop65\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Havit","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":39306054336589,"sku":"","price":22.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid_Plus_1618667931073.jpg?v=1687052501"},{"product_id":"havit-tw916-wireless-stereo-earbuds","title":"Havit TW916 Wireless Stereo Earbuds","description":"\u003cp\u003eHavit Earbuds TW916 (TWS earphones) features built-in microphone and media controls along with an ergonomic fit to ensure a great listening experience on your runs.  \u003cbr\u003eYou never have to worry about batteries wearing out. And with a five hour duration and charging case included you can listen to music and podcasts all day long. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe latest Bluetooth 5.0 standard offers a a 10 metre-reach, reduced use of power and a more stable connection. All in all you get a great set of earphones at this price. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eTouch Control\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTouch Control allows you to avoid having to push buttons making the earphones more user friendly  \u003cbr\u003eJust by touching the side you can easily and quickly switch songs or take calls. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWaterproof\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThey are IPX5 waterproof allowing you to sweat or run in the rain.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFunctions\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth 5.0\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eImpedans: 16 Ω\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStandbytime: 200 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFrequency: 20 Hz - 20 kHz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMedia call\/control\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTouch control\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePlaying time: 5 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCall duration: 4 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging time (charging case): 2 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging time: 1.5 hours max. (headphones)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eContents\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHavit Earbuds TW916\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMicro UBS-kable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging case\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Havit","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":43203890184414,"sku":"","price":28.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"White","offer_id":43203890217182,"sku":"","price":28.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid_Plus_1622494913411.jpg?v=1687052971"},{"product_id":"logitech-mk120-wired-keyboard-and-mouse-combo","title":"Logitech MK120 Wired Keyboard and Mouse Combo","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLogitech Desktop MK120. A durable duo that brings comfort, style, and simplicity together. You’ll be comfortable with the keyboard thanks to the low-profile, whisper-quiet keys and standard layout with full-size F-keys and number pad. With its thin profile, spill-resistant design,* durable keys that can withstand up to 10 million keystrokes** and sturdy, adjustable tilt legs, this sleek keyboard not only looks and feels good—it’s built to last. Plus, it’s got easy-to-read keys. The high-definition optical mouse puts comfort and control in your hands with smooth, accurate tracking and a comfortable, ambidextrous shape. And setup is simple—you just plug your keyboard and mouse into USB ports and start using them right out of the box. * Tested under limited conditions (maximum of 60 ml liquid spillage). Do not immerse keyboard in liquid. ** Excludes number lock key.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures \u0026amp; details\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"featurebullets_secondary_view_div\" class=\"a-section\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"feature-bullets\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-small\"\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eDurable and Reliable: This USB keyboard features a thin profile and curved space bar, spill-resistant design, durable keys that can withstand 10 million keystrokes and sturdy, adjustable tilt legs\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eComfortable, Quiet Typing: You’ll enjoy a comfortable and quiet typing experience thanks to the low-profile keys that barely make a sound and standard layout with full-size F-keys and number pad\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eFull-size Sculpted Mouse: The high-definition optical USB mouse puts comfort and control in your hands with smooth, accurate tracking and an ambidextrous shape that feels good hour after hour\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eSimple Set-Up: Simply plug the keyboard and mouse into the USB ports on your desktop, laptop, or netbook and you're ready to work; compatible with Windows 7, 8, 10 or later\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eClear and Convenient: The bold, bright white and long-lasting characters make the keys on this PC or laptop keyboard easy to read and extra durable\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Logitech","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43023562014942,"sku":"","price":20.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/products\/PhotoGrid_Plus_1656358767990.jpg?v=1656359184"},{"product_id":"logitech-mk270-wireless-keyboard-and-mouse-combo","title":"Logitech MK270 Wireless Keyboard And Mouse Combo","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe stylish Logitech MK270 Wireless Keyboard and Mouse Combo is perfect for the home office or workplace. Ditch the touchpad for this full size keyboard and mouse. Easily connect using Logitech's plug and forget receiver—just plug it into the USB port, and you're ready to work. There's no lengthy installation procedure to slow you down. When you're on the move, the receiver stores comfortably inside the mouse. Both the keyboard and mouse included in the MK270 combo use wireless 2.4GHz connectivity to provide seamless, interruption free use. Use the keyboard within a 10 m range without keyboard lag. Work for longer with the MK270's long battery life. The keyboard can be used for up to 24 months, and the mouse for 12 months, without replacing batteries. The Logitech MK270 keyboard includes 8 hotkeys that are programmable to your most used applications to boost your productivity\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures \u0026amp; details\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"featurebullets_secondary_view_div\" class=\"a-section\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"feature-bullets\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-small\"\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eReliable Plug and Play: The USB receiver provides a reliable wireless connection up to 33 ft (1), so you can forget about drop-outs and delays and you can take it wherever you use your computer\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eType in Comfort: The design of this keyboard creates a comfortable typing experience thanks to the low-profile, quiet keys and standard layout with full-size F-keys, number pad, and arrow keys\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eDurable and Resilient: This full-size wireless keyboard features a spill-resistant design (2), durable keys and sturdy tilt legs with adjustable height\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eLong Battery Life: MK270 combo features a 36-month keyboard and 12-month mouse battery life (3), along with on\/off switches allowing you to go months without the hassle of changing batteries\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eEasy to Use: This wireless keyboard and mouse combo features 8 multimedia hotkeys for instant access to the Internet, email, play\/pause, and volume so you can easily check out your favorite sites\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eComfortable Mouse: This compact wireless mouse is designed to be equally comfortable for both left- and right-handed users, plus its smooth cursor control allows easy navigation on most surfaces\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eFavorite Wireless Combo: MK270 brings together familiar typing, wireless freedom, and long battery life; no wonder this is the world's top-selling combo(4)\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Logitech","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43023654584542,"sku":"","price":30.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/products\/PhotoGrid_Plus_1656361720236.jpg?v=1656362160"},{"product_id":"logitech-mk220-wireless-keyboard-and-mouse-combo","title":"Logitech Mk220 Wireless Keyboard And Mouse Combo","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFREE TO ROAM The reliable wireless connection lets you work or play up to 10 meters (33 feet) away with virtually no delays or dropouts. GOOD LIFE You can go for months without battery hassles—24 months for the keyboard and 5 months for the mouse. MUCH SMALLER DESIGN, SAME KEYS The compact keyboard is about 36% smaller than standard keyboards but still has all the standard keys—so doing the things you love is as easy as ever. ADVANCED 2.4 GHZ WIRELESS So you can work or play in more places—like your comfy couch—the wireless connection virtually eliminates delays, dropouts and interference and gives you a range of up to 10 meters (33 feet). FEWER BATTERY HASSLES A 24-month keyboard and 5-month mouse battery life mean you can go for months without the hassle of changing batteries. SLEEK, MINIMALIST DESIGN The keyboard’s minimalist design not only blends in with your décor—it serves a purpose. No extra space between the keys makes it compact as well as sleek. PLUG-AND-PLAY SIMPLICITY Setup couldn’t be easier—you simply plug the wireless receiver into a USB port on your computer and start tweeting, blogging and IMing right away without software. WHISPER-QUIET KEYS The keys barely make a sound, so you can hear the song you’re listening to—instead of the sound of typing\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Logitech","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43023694299358,"sku":"","price":27.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/products\/PhotoGrid_Plus_1656362583555.jpg?v=1656362702"},{"product_id":"logitech-m170-wireless-mouse","title":"Logitech M170 Wireless Mouse","description":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media\/vc\/4734ca8b-6874-474d-87e0-19f00383adc8._SR970,300_.png\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media\/vc\/4734ca8b-6874-474d-87e0-19f00383adc8._SR970,300_.png\"\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-v2 mobile celwidget\" cel_widget_id=\"m-aplus\" data-csa-c-id=\"jddyxt-my0jvy-ltmqwl-xcsbt3\" data-cel-widget=\"m-aplus\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-1 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-module-1\" data-csa-c-id=\"hi7nks-ehjp44-ax5emw-bf1o5n\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-module-1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003eLogitech Wireless Mouse M170\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"apm-spacing apm-wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"apm-wrap\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-text-center\"\u003e\n\u003ch5 class=\"a-color-secondary a-text-center\"\u003eHighlights\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-box a-spacing-medium a-color-alternate-background apm-listbox\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-box-inner\"\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-size-base\"\u003eReliable 2.4Ghz wireless connection\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-size-base\"\u003e10 meter\/33 feet wireless range\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-size-base\"\u003e12 month battery life*\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-size-base\"\u003ePlug-and-play wireless receiver included\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-size-base\"\u003eWorks with Windows, Mac and Chrome OS\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"a-spacing-mini a-color-secondary a-text-italic\"\u003eStay productive with uninterrupted wireless.\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eEnjoy the convenience of a wireless mouse that gives you a connection as reliable as a corded mouse. With Logitech advanced wireless, M170 is the amazingly affordable mouse that helps you get work done without annoying wireless delays or dropouts. Just plug the tiny wireless receiver into a USB port and go.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003e*Battery life may vary based on user and computing conditions.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003eAdvanced 2.4Ghz wireless\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-size-small\"\u003eSay goodbye to cords with a wireless connection so powerful, it even works up to 10 meters (33 ft.) away from your computer.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e12 month battery life*\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-size-small\"\u003eGo for a year without battery changes with a single AA battery. Conserve power and maximize battery life with a flip of the On\/Off switch.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-size-small\"\u003e*Battery life may vary based on user and computing conditions\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003ePlug-and-forget wireless receiver\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-size-small\"\u003eSetup is a snap — no pairing hassles or software installation. Just plug the small receiver into a USB slot once and forget about it. The mouse automatically connects to your computer, so it’s always ready to go to work.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003eUniversal compatibility\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-size-small\"\u003eM170 works straight out of the box with Windows, Mac or Chrome OS. And it comes with all the dependability and performance you expect from Logitech, the world leader in mice.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"apm-rightthirdcol\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"apm-rightthirdcol-inner\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"a-spacing-small\"\u003eCompatibility\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eSystem Requirements\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section\"\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-size-base\"\u003eWindows10 or later, Windows 8, Windows 7\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-size-base\"\u003eMac OS X 10.8 or later\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-size-base\"\u003eChrome OS\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-size-base\"\u003eUSB port\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003eWhat’s in the box\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eWireless Mouse.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eUSB receiver.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003e1 AA battery.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eUser documentation.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Logitech","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43023722086622,"sku":"","price":15.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/products\/PhotoGrid_Plus_1656363295718.jpg?v=1656363318"},{"product_id":"havit-hv-h2575bt-bluetooth-headset","title":"Havit HV-H2575BT Bluetooth Headset","description":"\u003ch3\u003e10 meters bluetooth range\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUnplug with up to 10 meters of connection range, and enjoy wireless music and phone calls.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eRechargeable lithium battery\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith 5-6 hours of call duration, this headset frees up your hands when you're on the go – from biking to driving, you'll be able to stay connected. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eEasy operating\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSupports HD communications and music\/video playback. Track switching and volume adjustments can be made right from the headphones.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFolding structure design\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConvenient to carry. Scalable design, can suit difference head shape.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWith built-in FM radio function\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSupport Micro SD card to listen music, quick and easy.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMore Information:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChip: CW3.0\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight: 159g\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLength of Micro USB cable: 70cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging means: Micro USB cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth version: V3.0\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWireless operation range: 10m(without obstacles)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery:250mAH\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eProfiles supported:A2DP AVRCP HSP HFP\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTalk time: up to 5-6 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePlaying time: up to 5 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStandby time: up to 180 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging time：about 2 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoice chat: Supported\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoice prompt: Supported\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Havit","offers":[{"title":"Red","offer_id":43098007273694,"sku":"","price":20.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black","offer_id":43098007306462,"sku":"","price":20.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Gray","offer_id":43098007339230,"sku":"","price":20.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/products\/PhotoGrid_Plus_1657658360144.jpg?v=1657658625"},{"product_id":"havit-tw935-true-wireless-stereo-earbuds","title":"Havit TW935 True Wireless Stereo Earbuds","description":"\u003cul class=\"tabs wc-tabs\" role=\"tablist\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSmart touch control\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIncredible Sound Quality\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaster-slave switch\u003c\/li