obile celwidget\" cel_widget_id=\"m-aplus\" data-csa-c-id=\"4t2ek5-ngq2ou-hlfg8n-pve6j6\" data-cel-widget=\"m-aplus\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-10 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-module-10\" data-csa-c-id=\"jgqqo7-yy1xyc-vzpjse-bkt22b\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-module-10\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-text-center\"\u003e\n\u003cimg alt=\"Powered by Android 8.1 for Superior Functionality\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/820c1a75-0194-4e8c-a678-e4080961ec4c._SL300__.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini apm-middle-image\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/820c1a75-0194-4e8c-a678-e4080961ec4c._SL300__.jpg\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003ePowered by Android TV\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eMi Box S is powered by Android TV, easy to use and supports Google Assistant and Chromecast as well as delivering a world of content the whole family can enjoy\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-text-center\"\u003e\n\u003cimg alt=\"Acesso a multitud de contenido\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/005fd21f-0c7a-4a50-bda3-d67d4ac43c4e._SL300__.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini apm-middle-image\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/005fd21f-0c7a-4a50-bda3-d67d4ac43c4e._SL300__.jpg\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003eAccess Tons of Content\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eCompatible with thousands of apps, giving you access to tons of premium video services and a constant stream of fresh new content\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-text-center\"\u003e\n\u003cimg alt=\"SmartCast\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/e89380c6-0d37-4d21-bed2-c782703b2662._SL300__.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini apm-middle-image\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/e89380c6-0d37-4d21-bed2-c782703b2662._SL300__.jpg\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003eSmartCast\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eDive into a bigger, better viewing experience\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-text-center\"\u003e\n\u003cimg alt=\"With the Google Assistant\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/3939c210-6da7-454a-8a49-4cdc20c7d415._SL300__.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini apm-middle-image\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/3939c210-6da7-454a-8a49-4cdc20c7d415._SL300__.jpg\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003eGoogle Assistant\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eWith the Google Assistant, you can quickly access entertainment, get answers and control devices around your home. Just press the mic button on your remote to get started.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-2 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-module-2\" data-csa-c-id=\"55i169-8ctcui-93hokp-nxlc1c\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-module-2\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper apm-spacing apm-floatnone\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"High Clarity 4K HDR\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/e4536b10-4cc7-4399-b6c7-ece6abecd7bc.__CR607,6,1422,1422_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/e4536b10-4cc7-4399-b6c7-ece6abecd7bc.__CR607,6,1422,1422_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003eHigh Clarity 4K HDR\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures the latest 4K HDR technology and high-speed 4K processing for up to 60fps playback. Enjoy an ultra high-definition, lifelike viewing experience\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-12 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-module-12\" data-csa-c-id=\"2srvnf-56w3a7-c75b3a-tb215p\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-module-12\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Premium Audio puts you in the action\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/85b5b65b-190d-497d-9e89-027fb9562e4b.__CR0,50,2560,792_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/85b5b65b-190d-497d-9e89-027fb9562e4b.__CR0,50,2560,792_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDolby and DTS deliver crisper, three-dimensional surround sound\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-11 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-module-11\" data-csa-c-id=\"cufy6w-6mnhk2-omw0n0-tjlos4\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-module-11\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"High Performance Storage Capacity\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/98ee33c8-801d-47f4-a7c0-7595929d4235.__CR0,437,2560,792_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/98ee33c8-801d-47f4-a7c0-7595929d4235.__CR0,437,2560,792_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eHigh Performance Storage Capacity\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInstall tons of awesome apps, watch extended cuts, and play more games while enjoying faster performance and stability\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-9 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-module-9\" data-csa-c-id=\"si8o2-t7kvzx-b47lhi-h1fwuf\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-module-9\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"a-spacing-small\"\u003eSupports Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, and USB connections, delivering super fast transfer speeds\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Xiaomi","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43515695792350,"sku":"","price":45.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/products\/PhotoGrid_Plus_1665517869919.jpg?v=1665518033"},{"product_id":"havit-m3-multi-function-digital-alarm-clock-with-bluetooth-speaker","title":"Havit M3 Multi-function Digital Alarm Clock with Bluetooth Speaker","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"summary entry-summary\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"product_meta\"\u003e\n\u003cimg decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-7895 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/www.havit.hk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/04\/M3-PPT_01.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1891\" height=\"1759\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.havit.hk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/04\/M3-PPT_01.jpg 1891w, https:\/\/www.havit.hk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/04\/M3-PPT_01-600x558.jpg 600w, https:\/\/www.havit.hk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/04\/M3-PPT_01-300x279.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.havit.hk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/04\/M3-PPT_01-1024x953.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.havit.hk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/04\/M3-PPT_01-768x714.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.havit.hk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/04\/M3-PPT_01-1536x1429.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1891px) 100vw, 1891px\"\u003e