ant (Certified ABS and PC Material)\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRubber Stand at the Bottom for Better Placement\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRated Current 10A\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRated Voltage 250 V\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRated Power 2500W\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePackage Dimension (cm): 25x14x7p\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePackage Weight: 0.48kg\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"MOXOM","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43998615699678,"sku":"","price":18.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/products\/PhotoGrid_Plus_1676590593352.jpg?v=1676632692"},{"product_id":"xiaomi-mi-tv-stick-2k-1080p-hdr","title":"Xiaomi Mi TV Stick 2k 1080P HDR Streaming Media Player","description":"\u003cdiv id=\"aplus_feature_div\" class=\"celwidget\" data-feature-name=\"aplus\" data-csa-c-type=\"widget\" data-csa-c-content-id=\"aplus\" data-csa-c-slot-id=\"aplus_feature_div\" data-csa-c-asin=\"\" data-csa-c-is-in-initial-active-row=\"false\" data-csa-c-id=\"wm19cf-e3urer-5yd2e5-tiq6qj\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus_feature_div\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui-deck dp-widget-card-deck celwidget\" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter=\"\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-12\" data-csa-c-id=\"33q5g7-oc8ga5-iqd459-lz0khh\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-12-card0\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-v2 mobile celwidget\" cel_widget_id=\"m-aplus\" data-csa-c-id=\"hqk6li-2snawn-8l6j6x-uhwqvj\" data-cel-widget=\"m-aplus\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module premium-module-2-fullbackground-image aplus-premium\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-premium-module-2-fullbackground-image\" data-csa-c-id=\"118c9s-c7ryx2-ajxbmb-bn1mb3\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-premium-module-2-fullbackground-image\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus premium-aplus-module-2\"\u003e\n\u003ch1 class=\"a-text-center aplus-container-3 aplus-h1 a-text-bold\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"xiaomi mi tv stick 2k\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/W\/IMAGERENDERING_521856-T1\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/55b63a3b-9f34-4227-8aea-3024be570b92.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.jpg\" class=\"background-image\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/W\/IMAGERENDERING_521856-T1\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/55b63a3b-9f34-4227-8aea-3024be570b92.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module premium-module-2-fullbackground-image aplus-premium\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-premium-module-2-fullbackground-image\" data-csa-c-id=\"1mm9cs-vp2i4l-91dwvk-ec71dt\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-premium-module-2-fullbackground-image\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus premium-aplus-module-2\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"xiaomi mi tv stick 2k\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/W\/IMAGERENDERING_521856-T1\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/6bf77392-7491-4e5d-8414-c311cf39c83d.__CR0,0,800,600_PT0_SX600_V1___.jpg\" class=\"background-image\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/W\/IMAGERENDERING_521856-T1\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/6bf77392-7491-4e5d-8414-c311cf39c83d.__CR0,0,800,600_PT0_SX600_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module premium-module-2-fullbackground-image aplus-premium\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-premium-module-2-fullbackground-image\" data-csa-c-id=\"hmt4fa-zi0ag9-f2o26r-cdc5dj\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-premium-module-2-fullbackground-image\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus premium-aplus-module-2\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"xiaomi mi tv stick 2k\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/W\/IMAGERENDERING_521856-T1\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/8d038fe6-13e0-4978-b350-ffc4e5fd9170.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.jpg\" class=\"background-image\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/W\/IMAGERENDERING_521856-T1\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/8d038fe6-13e0-4978-b350-ffc4e5fd9170.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module premium-module-1-image-text aplus-premium\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-premium-module-1-image-text\" data-csa-c-id=\"yei1q5-2sa1c5-gtz82k-186ffe\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-premium-module-1-image-text\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus premium-aplus-module-1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none aplus-module-section aplus-image-section\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"xiaomi mi tv stick 2k\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/W\/IMAGERENDERING_521856-T1\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/31c6b1b2-6d22-4a83-b3d1-78c04ac73ef1.__CR0,0,800,600_PT0_SX800_V1___.jpg\" class=\"\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/W\/IMAGERENDERING_521856-T1\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/31c6b1b2-6d22-4a83-b3d1-78c04ac73ef1.__CR0,0,800,600_PT0_SX800_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none aplus-module-section aplus-text-section aplus-container-2\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"aplus-module-1-topic aplus-accent1 a-text-bold\"\u003eSmarter Experience with Android TV 9.0\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"aplus-p1\"\u003eMi TV Stick is powered by Android TV 9.0 which supports voice search and Chromecast connecting you to a world of content.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"aplus-p1\"\u003eCatch up on your favorite TV shows, play games, watch the news or turn on the radio.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"aplus-p1\"\u003eMi TV Stick also recommends videos based on your personal Youtube and Google Play preferences!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"aplus-p1\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-text-bold\"\u003eQuad-core CPU | 3+2-core GPU | 1GB RAM | 8GB ROM\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module premium-module-1-image-text aplus-premium\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-premium-module-1-image-text\" data-csa-c-id=\"j4kmix-gk8a2z-3y1oma-x6m3y3\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-premium-module-1-image-text\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus premium-aplus-module-1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none aplus-module-section aplus-image-section\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"xiaomi mi tv stick 2k\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/W\/IMAGERENDERING_521856-T1\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/f51368b5-9d31-46f8-b257-a4fcd5a8de34.__CR0,0,800,600_PT0_SX800_V1___.jpg\" class=\"\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/W\/IMAGERENDERING_521856-T1\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/f51368b5-9d31-46f8-b257-a4fcd5a8de34.__CR0,0,800,600_PT0_SX800_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none aplus-module-section aplus-text-section aplus-container-2\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"aplus-module-1-topic aplus-accent1 a-text-bold\"\u003eLight and Portable\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch1 class=\"aplus-h1 aplus-heading a-text-bold\"\u003eSmart Cast\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"aplus-p1\"\u003eWith built-in Chromecast you can easily cast videos and other content from your phone, tablet or laptop directly to your TV screen in 1080p.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003col class=\"a-ordered-list a-vertical\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eTap to cast wirelessly\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eCast from your iPhone, iPad, Android device or laptop to your TV\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eTake calls without interrupting what's playing on the TV\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eHigh speed streaming HD playback\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ol\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module premium-module-2-fullbackground-image aplus-premium\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-premium-module-2-fullbackground-image\" data-csa-c-id=\"nzc95t-qfj1fo-hqnvcf-o4jzvy\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-premium-module-2-fullbackground-image\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus premium-aplus-module-2\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Xiaomi Mi TV Stick  2K Android TV 9.0\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/W\/IMAGERENDERING_521856-T1\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/8318b9c6-78a1-40ce-814b-08bec34e23d5.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.jpg\" class=\"background-image\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/W\/IMAGERENDERING_521856-T1\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/8318b9c6-78a1-40ce-814b-08bec34e23d5.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets_feature_div\" class=\"celwidget\" data-feature-name=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets_RI\" data-csa-c-type=\"widget\" data-csa-c-content-id=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets_RI\" data-csa-c-slot-id=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets_feature_div\" data-csa-c-asin=\"\" data-csa-c-is-in-initial-active-row=\"false\" data-csa-c-id=\"b9xc0j-qcp5su-mcbhot-obqu9f\" data-cel-widget=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets_feature_div\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui-deck dp-widget-card-deck celwidget\" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter=\"\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-16\" data-csa-c-id=\"unly36-hr0yks-qfvztp-v6ojr\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-16-card0\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-feature-name=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets\" data-template-name=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures \u0026amp; details\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"featurebullets_secondary_view_div\" class=\"a-section\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"feature-bullets\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-small\"\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eLight and Portable: At less than 30g, the TV stick weighs no more than a cherry tomato and is small enough to easily fit in your pocket. Forget about cables, plug the stick into any TV, monitor or projector with an HDMI port to turn it into a smart TV!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eEasy to set up: Set up your Mi TV Stick in an instant. Just three easy steps to get going and you can start enjoying everything the Mi TV stick has to offer in no time!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eLimitless Entertainment: download your favorite streaming and gaming apps and stay entertained for hours.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eSmarter Experience with Android TV: Mi TV Stick is powered by Android TV 9.0 which supports voice search connecting you to a world of content. Catch up on your favorite TV shows, play games, watch the news or turn on the radio. Mi TV Stick also recommends videos based on your personal Youtube and Google Play preferences!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eBluetooth remote: No more typing. Press the mic button on your remote to quickly find what you're looking for, whether you're searching for your favorite show, song or asking about the weather.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Xiaomi","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44091654537438,"sku":"","price":37.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/products\/PhotoGrid_Plus_1679348196559.jpg?v=1679348619"},{"product_id":"moxom-mx-st05-safety-power-strip-with-4-sockets-8-usb-ports6x-usb-2x-usb-type-c","title":"Moxom MX-ST05 Safety power strip with 4 Sockets \u0026 8 USB Ports(6x USB, 2x USB Type-C)","description":"\u003cp\u003eSafety power strip with 4 Sockets \u0026amp; 8 USB Ports\u003cspan\u003e(6x USB, 2x USB Type-C) \u003c\/span\u003e3.4A 17W Moxom MX-ST05\u003cbr\u003e– Smooth and Elegant Lines – Unique circle s   hape, and every thoughtful details provides the best experience for you ever.\u003cbr\u003e– Compact and stylish design – The design appearance gives you a magnificent visual experience.\u003cbr\u003e– Premium Eco-friendly Material – Dust-proof, easy to clean.\u003cbr\u003e– Home and Travel – Designed for home and travel. Portable, lightweight, easy\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaterial: ABS + PC\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoltage: AC100 – 240V, 50-60HZ\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePower: 10A \/ 2500W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSockets: 4\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUSB number: 8 (6x USB, 2x USB Type-C)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUSB output: DC5V-3.4A (Max), 17W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eON \/ OFF button: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCable length: 1.8 m\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 32 x 8.5 x 4 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlack color\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCertifications: RoHS, CE\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"MOXOM","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":44124557541598,"sku":"","price":15.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"White","offer_id":44124557574366,"sku":"","price":15.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/products\/PhotoGrid_Plus_1680468837607.jpg?v=1680469113"},{"product_id":"ag-high-power-ups-2000va","title":"AG High Power UPS 2000va","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePerfect for PS4 Pro Consoles- PS5 Consoles- Xbox Series S|X Consoles- Gaming PCs\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"AG Power","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44694621487326,"sku":"","price":60.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid-Plus_1717794665230.jpg?v=1717794744"},{"product_id":"havit-gamenote-h95-usb-hub-multi-interface","title":"Havit Gamenote H95 USB HUB MULTI-INTERFACE","description":"","brand":"Havit","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45994237722846,"sku":"","price":16.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/1-scaled-e1717081254206.jpg?v=1730233722"},{"product_id":"usb-3-0-lan-connection-adapter-for-nintedno-switch-windows-mac","title":"USB 3.0 Lan Connection Adapter For Nintedno Switch, Windows \u0026 Mac","description":"","brand":"iPlay","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45998044643550,"sku":"","price":10.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid-Plus_1730321690660.jpg?v=1730322782"},{"product_id":"wooden-digital-photo-frame-wireless-electronic-photo-album-10-1-inch-32gb-auto-rotate-motion-sensor-ips-touch-screen","title":"Wooden Digital Photo Frame Wireless Electronic Photo Album - 10.1-inch 32GB, Auto-Rotate, Motion Sensor, IPS Touch Screen","description":"\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eEasy Sharing】This digital picture frame with app will upload your life moments with your beloved ones instantly wherever you are. Simply install the VPhoto app or prepare an email account, then enjoy wonderful moments on the digital frames for photos within seconds. Share a smile each day with photos on the digital photo frame to stay connected.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e【Large Storage】Built-in 32GB memory and extend micro-SD card (not included) empower a huge capability of storage. The electronic picture frame boasting large storage lets new memories join days gone by without sacrificing any along the way. Choose our digital photo frame with USB port to showcase what makes the relationship unique.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e【Smart Sensor】Customized motion sensor and auto-rotate setting support your better viewing experience, you can place this photo share digital frame in either portrait or landscape mode, or even mount it on the wall. The auto-rotate feature ensures that photos and videos on the digital photo frames you can email pictures to are always displayed perfectly.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e【Awesome Gift】The digital photo frame has many functions like music, calendar, alarm, clock, weather station, etc. For loved ones far and near, a digital picture frame makes the perfect gift for staying close through photos highlighting life's moments. Suitable for different scenarios, birthdays, Christmas, Mother’s Day, Father’s Day, etc.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e【Secure \u0026amp; Trusted】You can send pics to the digital frame with our own R\u0026amp;D Software and Cloud system, which is secure and trusted. We provide comprehensive after-sales service, including 24-hour customer service and a one-year warranty. If you have any questions about the digital photo frame, please feel free to contact us.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Gamers Stop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":46077745496286,"sku":"","price":60.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid-Plus_1732056853744.jpg?v=1732057366"},{"product_id":"ag-high-power-ups-3000va","title":"AG High Power UPS 3000va","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePerfect for PS4 Pro Consoles- PS5 Consoles- Xbox Series S|X Consoles- Gaming PCs\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"AG Power","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":46512178135262,"sku":null,"price":90.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid-Plus_1717794665230.jpg?v=1717794744"},{"product_id":"fujifilm-instax-mini-film-pack-of-10","title":"Fujifilm Instax Mini Film","description":"\u003cp\u003eFor Fujifilm instax mini Cameras.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e• Credit Card-Sized Prints.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e• ISO 800\/30°.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e• Daylight-Balanced Film.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e• Glossy Surface Type.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e• Vibrant Colors and Natural Skin Tones.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e• Excellent Sharpness and Grain Structure.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Instax","offers":[{"title":"Pack of 10","offer_id":49164655689950,"sku":null,"price":13.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Pack of 20","offer_id":49164655722718,"sku":null,"price":23.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_437e7f8d-b669-4788-9aa7-b7932c041d65.jpg?v=1758219745"},{"product_id":"xiaomi-smart-camera-c300-2k-clarity-360-vision-ai-human-detection-f1-4-large-aperture-and-6p-lens-enhanced-color-night-vision-in-low-light-full-encryption-for-privacy-protection","title":"Xiaomi Smart Camera C300, 2K Clarity, 360° Vision, AI Human Detection, F1.4 Large Aperture and 6P Lens, Enhanced Color Night Vision in Low Light, Full Encryption for Privacy Protection","description":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"c300 patr1\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/d15b64af-9a76-48fb-a9f3-4b2ffe29c15a.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-base\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/d15b64af-9a76-48fb-a9f3-4b2ffe29c15a.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-v2 mobile celwidget\" cel_widget_id=\"m-aplus\" data-csa-c-id=\"cn3a3a-jkxms2-jhhzrw-xtmn04\" data-cel-widget=\"m-aplus\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module 3p-module-b aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\" data-csa-c-id=\"y8ximi-g5ab8x-dysbh7-s47ehz\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003e2K ultra-clear HD*, fully upgraded image quality F1.4 large aperture for clear picture even under low-light conditions. Clear images even in low-light. The AI human detection effectively filters false alarms.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module 3p-module-b aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\" data-csa-c-id=\"cz7jsj-x21uo6-ckzg8b-ayc939\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-3p-center-content\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"c300 part2\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/76b54744-4b92-4c2b-8208-e13b78c19a7a.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-base\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/76b54744-4b92-4c2b-8208-e13b78c19a7a.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module 3p-module-b aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\" data-csa-c-id=\"bxn2yn-f0v72j-v0c9w9-t5wpyb\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-3p-center-content\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"c300 part3\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/f82f1bb9-f990-4def-8f29-f102793de18f.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-base\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/f82f1bb9-f990-4def-8f29-f102793de18f.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-9 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-module-9\" data-csa-c-id=\"nashud-822tv4-3yte2r-nicx9t\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-module-9\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"c300 part4.1\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/ed43c01d-2196-4dd3-bad4-bedf1b09d8d3.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/ed43c01d-2196-4dd3-bad4-bedf1b09d8d3.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-text-bold\"\u003e2K ultra-clear HD*, fully upgraded image quality\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eEnjoy an improved visual experience with fully upgraded 2K ultra-clear HD technology.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eTrue clarity in every frame.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003e* Standard HD resolution: 1920 × 1080=1080p (2 megapixel);\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eUpgraded ultra-clear HD resolution: 2304 × 1296=1296p (3 megapixel)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"c300 part4.2\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/3f031a53-9153-4933-9e44-e196f9749acf.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/3f031a53-9153-4933-9e44-e196f9749acf.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-text-bold\"\u003eF1.4 large aperture for clear picture even under low-light conditions\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eThe F1.4 large aperture lens lets significantly more light enter, capturing detailed images even in low-light conditions.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"c300 part4.3\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/47f35e1a-2d33-490d-8da5-cbe6dd462688.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/47f35e1a-2d33-490d-8da5-cbe6dd462688.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-text-bold\"\u003eClear images even in low-light\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eFeatures a high-sensitivity image sensor,u2028and displays colour video even under low-light conditions.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-9 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-module-9\" data-csa-c-id=\"zgv80b-efqce8-agkela-6r52qy\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-module-9\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"c300 part5.1\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/26cbbf9f-2493-48a4-9046-85b450d8a55b.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/26cbbf9f-2493-48a4-9046-85b450d8a55b.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-text-bold\"\u003eThe AI human detection effectively filters false alarms\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eWith a combination of deep-learning applications, as well as algorithm and network optimisation, AI effectively filters false alarms for improved accuracy.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"c300 part5.2\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/a59aa28d-97da-4a75-ba56-65daf9b33b33.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/a59aa28d-97da-4a75-ba56-65daf9b33b33.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-text-bold\"\u003eTwo-way voice calls in real time, so you can \"visit home\" whenever you like\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eSupports two-way real-time voice calling that feels like a face-to-face conversation, so you can chat intimately with your loved ones no matter where you are.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"c300 part5.3\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/13b11408-1ba5-493b-8192-1341beb49f79.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/13b11408-1ba5-493b-8192-1341beb49f79.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-text-bold\"\u003e360° pan-tilt-zoom panoramic view for all-round monitoring with no blind spots\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eFeatures a dual-axis pan-tilt-zoom motor, with a 360° horizontal viewing angle and 108° vertical viewing angle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Xiaomi","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47542864019678,"sku":null,"price":35.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_208f54b5-bf15-4fcc-b1ca-cff3d2e20657.jpg?v=1758221749"},{"product_id":"xiaomi-smart-camera-c301-3mp-infrared-night-vision-360-horizontally-and-107-vertically-human-detection-protecting-privacy-two-way-voice-calls","title":"Xiaomi Smart Camera C301 | 3MP | Infrared Night Vision | 360° horizontally and 107° vertically | Human Detection | protecting privacy | two-way voice calls","description":"\u003ch3\u003eFrom the manufacturer\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-v2 mobile celwidget\" cel_widget_id=\"m-aplus\" data-csa-c-id=\"t6tea1-oibtnh-k4etxn-k05i2b\" data-cel-widget=\"m-aplus\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module 3p-module-b aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\" data-csa-c-id=\"n9d2t9-fnex1t-xeyg4n-lrz55w\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-3p-center-content\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"c301 part1\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/8bae0ba3-92bd-4d6b-81a9-e61a595fbaac.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-base\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/8bae0ba3-92bd-4d6b-81a9-e61a595fbaac.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module 3p-module-b aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\" data-csa-c-id=\"vujref-k9u7l6-epnyi-y7v7fr\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-3p-center-content\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"c301 part2\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/918b40a3-52f7-4939-92ff-2c09bb5096aa.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-base\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/918b40a3-52f7-4939-92ff-2c09bb5096aa.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module 3p-module-b aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\" data-csa-c-id=\"nerdd-1yul8c-iy2wl9-ys4igt\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-3p-center-content\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"c301 part3\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/6ed0dbfe-f33c-4530-88c1-58e38bdf856d.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-base\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/6ed0dbfe-f33c-4530-88c1-58e38bdf856d.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-9 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-module-9\" data-csa-c-id=\"wl4lm0-62kf97-yfenye-sby5nj\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-module-9\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"c301 part4.1\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/c4d76e68-a015-42c1-93e4-32e5aa222d8b.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/c4d76e68-a015-42c1-93e4-32e5aa222d8b.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-text-bold\"\u003ePhysical lens shielding, protecting privacy at the source\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eThe camera lens can be hidden upwards into the body for physical shielding, ensuring security and peace of mind.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"c301 part4.2\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/7c505d9c-3ec5-476c-babb-0ccde94c5a1c.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/7c505d9c-3ec5-476c-babb-0ccde94c5a1c.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-text-bold\"\u003eMJA1 security chip, finance-grade data protection\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eEach chip has a unique key and credential, effectively ensuring data communication and storage security, and providing reassuring finance-grade protection.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"c301 part4.3\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/063e35b3-fc49-407d-9bd2-8d63d79d2d72.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/063e35b3-fc49-407d-9bd2-8d63d79d2d72.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-text-bold\"\u003e3MP ultra-clear visual experience\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eWith 3MP and a resolution of 2304x1296, the camera displays 2K images, providing more subtle details and more realistic visuals.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-9 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-module-9\" data-csa-c-id=\"dz8thu-3487cz-28flgk-i3k805\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-module-9\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"c301 part5.1\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/71e2ccfc-aff7-4af6-9dca-6ef8739980c5.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/71e2ccfc-aff7-4af6-9dca-6ef8739980c5.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-text-bold\"\u003eEnhanced infrared night vision for clear images on dark nights\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eThe camera has six built-in infrared illuminators and can capture clear images even on dark nights without producing red light or disturbing your family's sleep.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"c301 part5.1\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/7671c9e6-7afb-4d92-81a9-922600c0899c.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/7671c9e6-7afb-4d92-81a9-922600c0899c.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-text-bold\"\u003eFull colour night vision for longer colour image time\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eWith the assistance of the built-in high-sensitivity image sensor, the camera can better adapt to low-light environments and retain colour images for a long period of time.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"c301 part5.3\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/d653abbd-3788-4cf7-909a-4d1ceef4d2bc.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/d653abbd-3788-4cf7-909a-4d1ceef4d2bc.__CR0,0,300,300_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-text-bold\"\u003eHuman detection and active alert\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eThe camera supports local AI-based human detection to detect humans more accurately and quickly without on-cloud processing. When someone is detected, the camera automatically sends an alert to your smartphone.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Xiaomi","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47542877585630,"sku":null,"price":32.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_c5ddce7d-e753-4d0f-91bb-e80819e696d5.jpg?v=1758222198"},{"product_id":"xiaomi-mi-children-anti-blue-ray-protection-glasses-hmj03ts","title":"Xiaomi Mi Kids Anti Blue Ray Protection Glasses HMJ03TS","description":"\u003cp\u003eXIAOMI Mijia HMJ03TS Kids Glasses Blue-light Resistant with Clear Lens – Pink\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEffectively protect your kids' eye\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDouble-lens is coated with anti-oil \u0026amp; dust film, features with excellent UV protection ability\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eErgonomical and adjustable bridge for enhancing wearing comfort and increasing applicability\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFlexible and durable TR90 frame, shock-absorbent, lightweight to wear\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e180 degree bendable frame leg enables you to freely adjust the angle of closure\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe lens are made of plastic, ultra-clear\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGross Weight 0.202kg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVolume Weight 0.108kg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLength 16.000cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWidth 6.000cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeight 5,000cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight 0.180kg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWith Retail Packaging Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Xiaomi","offers":[{"title":"Blue","offer_id":47546710851806,"sku":null,"price":20.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Pink","offer_id":47546712490206,"sku":null,"price":20.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_f1071d2b-d178-476a-bc50-cd41f12e5fe8.jpg?v=1758410515"},{"product_id":"untitled-11feb_12-46","title":"Meetion MT_SP2110 2.1 Office Desktop Speaker + Bluetooth","description":"\u003carticle class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [\u0026amp;:has([data-writing-block])\u0026gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-(--header-height)\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"2cd3d759-e31a-4acc-bcc1-0fd06d53289a\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-7\" data-scroll-anchor=\"false\" data-turn=\"user\" tabindex=\"-1\"\u003e\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [\u0026amp;:has([data-writing-block])\u0026gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:b128cab6-fabc-4b60-a6e5-a54692962d6c-3\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-8\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\" tabindex=\"-1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm\/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg\/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg\/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group\/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"7c1e77a0-01e3-4335-a0c8-4a19a2f3c584\" dir=\"auto\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+\u0026amp;]:mt-1\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-2\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"452\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"\u003eThe \u003cstrong data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"25\"\u003eMeetion MT-SP2110\u003c\/strong\u003e is a compact 2.1-channel speaker system designed to enhance your desktop audio experience. Featuring a dedicated subwoofer and dual satellite speakers, it delivers clear sound with enhanced bass performance. With multiple connectivity options including Bluetooth and AUX, it offers flexible compatibility for PCs, laptops, and mobile devices. Its stylish design and USB power support make it a practical addition to any setup.\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eABOUT THIS ITEM\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e5W Output\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHigh Volume Bass\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUltimate 2.1 Channel Audio Experience\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2.1 channel speaker system with powerful bass\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMultiple connection options: Bluetooth, AUX (3.5mm), USB\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompact and stylish design, perfect for desktop use\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eModel-MT-SP2110\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpeaker-4Ω\/5W + 3W*2\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSNR-≥45db\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInterface-USB\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCable Length-1.20±0.01m\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Meetion","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47891599032542,"sku":null,"price":18.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/square-image_2_1bbfa105-e167-443e-872d-ce8491c007b9.jpg?v=1770988349"},{"product_id":"google-tv-streamer-4k-32-gb-porcelain","title":"Google TV Streamer (4k) 32 GB - Porcelain","description":"\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eThe Google TV Streamer (4K) delivers your favorite entertainment quickly, easily, and personalized to you.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eHDMI 2.1 cable required (sold separately).\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eSee movies and TV shows from all your services right from your home screen; and find new things to watch with tailored recommendations for everyone in your home based on their interests and viewing habits.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eWatch live TV and access over 800 free channels from Pluto TV, Tubi, and more; if you find an interesting show or movie on your TV, mobile app, or Google search, you can easily add it to your watchlist, so it’s ready when you are.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eUp to 4K HDR with Dolby Vision delivers captivating, true-to-life detail; and you can connect speakers that support Dolby Atmos for more immersive 3D sound.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eThe Google TV Streamer (4K) has a 22% faster processor and twice the memory of the previous generation for smooth navigation and quick switching between apps; with 32 GB of storage, you can install more of your favorite apps.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eWith the redesigned remote, use your voice to find shows, get answers, and control smart home devices; the customizable button lets you open your favorite app or the home panel in one click; and easily find your lost remote by making it ring.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-row a-expander-container a-expander-inline-container\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-expander-content a-expander-extend-content a-expander-content-expanded\" data-expanded=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eIt’s even easier to control your smart home with the new home panel; dim the lights or check a camera’s live view without pausing your shows.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eEffortlessly cast content from multiple compatible Android and iOS apps on your phone, tablet, or laptop right to your Google TV Streamer (4K).\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Google","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47891615187166,"sku":null,"price":115.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/square-image.jpg?v=1770809213"},{"product_id":"xiaomi-tv-box-s-4k-ultra-hd","title":"Xiaomi TV Box S 4K Ultra HD 3rd Gen - 1 year warranty","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"122\" data-end=\"693\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe Xiaomi TV Box S\u003c\/strong\u003e transforms any television into a smart home entertainment hub, delivering stunning 4K Ultra HD resolution and vivid cinematic visuals. Powered by Google TV™, this streaming device brings together over 10,000 apps, free channels, and personalized recommendations in one intuitive interface. With support for Dolby Vision and HDR10+, every scene is rendered with remarkable color depth and clarity, while Dolby Atmos and DTS:X create a surround sound experience that turns your living room into a home theater.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"1288\"\u003eEngineered for performance, the TV box incorporates a 6nm high-efficiency chipset featuring a 64-bit quad-core A55 CPU that reaches up to 2.5GHz, enabling faster load times and smooth multitasking. Thanks to its 2GB RAM and expanded 32GB storage, users can download more apps and cache larger media files without compromise. With integrated Wi-Fi 6 and Bluetooth 5.2, streaming and connectivity are faster and more reliable than ever. Built for both function and design, the compact and stylish device also includes a 360° Bluetooth voice remote, ensuring complete control with minimal effort.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1322\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1322\"\u003eKey Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"2484\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1502\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1502\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1377\"\u003e4K UHD Resolution with HDR10+ and Dolby Vision:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1380\"\u003eVisuals are enhanced with cinematic quality, offering superior brightness, contrast, and color for more lifelike images.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1504\" data-end=\"1659\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1659\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1536\"\u003eDolby Atmos \u0026amp; DTS:X Audio:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1539\"\u003eThese premium audio technologies create a multi-dimensional sound environment that immerses the viewer in the content.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1661\" data-end=\"1870\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1663\" data-end=\"1870\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1663\" data-end=\"1689\"\u003eGoogle TV™ Experience:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"1689\" data-end=\"1692\"\u003eGoogle’s powerful entertainment platform organizes apps, content, and profiles seamlessly. Voice search and Assistant support allow hands-free operation and smart home control.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1872\" data-end=\"2049\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"2049\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1903\"\u003eHigh-Performance Chipset:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"1903\" data-end=\"1906\"\u003eEquipped with a quad-core A55 processor and ARM G310 GPU, performance is improved by 25% in CPU and 130% in GPU over the previous generation.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2207\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2207\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2078\"\u003eWi-Fi 6 Connectivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"2078\" data-end=\"2081\"\u003eDesigned for ultra-fast internet access with minimal latency, ideal for streaming high-resolution content without buffering.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2209\" data-end=\"2354\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2354\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2237\"\u003e360° Bluetooth Remote:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2240\"\u003eNavigation is simplified through voice commands and a responsive Bluetooth connection that works from any angle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2356\" data-end=\"2484\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2358\" data-end=\"2484\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2358\" data-end=\"2386\"\u003eElegant, Compact Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"2386\" data-end=\"2389\"\u003eThe sleek, pebble-shaped design blends well with modern home setups while remaining discreet.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2491\" data-end=\"2522\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2491\" data-end=\"2520\"\u003eTechnical Specifications:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2525\" data-end=\"2538\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2525\" data-end=\"2536\"\u003eDesign:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2543\" data-end=\"2575\"\u003eDimensions: 97mm × 97mm × 17mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2615\"\u003eWeight: 91.2g (without packaging)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2620\" data-end=\"2634\"\u003eColor: Black\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2638\" data-end=\"2653\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2638\" data-end=\"2651\"\u003ePlatform:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2658\" data-end=\"2695\"\u003eOutput Resolution: 4K (3840 × 2160)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2700\" data-end=\"2731\"\u003eCPU: Quad-Core (up to 2.5GHz)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2736\" data-end=\"2754\"\u003eGPU: ARM G310 V2\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2759\" data-end=\"2769\"\u003eRAM: 2GB\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2785\"\u003eROM: 32GB\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2790\" data-end=\"2820\"\u003eOperating System: Google TV™\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2825\" data-end=\"2856\"\u003eVideo Decoder: Up to 4K 60FPS\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2861\" data-end=\"2898\"\u003eAudio: Supports Dolby Audio®, DTS:X\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2903\" data-end=\"2943\"\u003eVisual: Supports Dolby Vision®, HDR10+\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2947\" data-end=\"2966\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2947\" data-end=\"2964\"\u003eConnectivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2971\" data-end=\"3013\"\u003eWi-Fi: 2.4GHz \/ 5GHz (Wi-Fi 6 supported)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3018\" data-end=\"3034\"\u003eBluetooth: 5.2\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3039\" data-end=\"3094\"\u003ePorts: HDMI 2.1 × 1, USB 2.0 × 1, Power Interface × 1\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"3098\" data-end=\"3113\"\u003eIn the Box:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3120\" data-end=\"3151\"\u003eXiaomi TV Box S (3rd Gen) × 1\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3156\" data-end=\"3176\"\u003eRemote Control × 1\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3181\" data-end=\"3200\"\u003ePower Adapter × 1\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3205\" data-end=\"3221\"\u003eHDMI Cable × 1\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3226\" data-end=\"3243\"\u003eUser Manual × 1\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Xiaomi","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47896877531358,"sku":null,"price":75.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/Xiaomi-TV-Box-S-3rd-Gen-4K-2GB-32GB-Global-Version-Android-Streaming-Media-Player-xiaomi-stores-kenya-xiaomi-stores-kenya.webp?v=1770981205"},{"product_id":"jbl-bar-800mk2-7-1-channel-dolby-atmos®-soundbar","title":"JBL Bar 800MK2 - 7.1 Channel Dolby Atmos® Soundbar System","description":"\u003cp data-end=\"666\" data-start=\"137\"\u003eThe\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"222\" data-start=\"176\"\u003eJBL Bar 800MK2 7.1 Channel Soundbar System\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003edelivers a true home theater experience with powerful surround sound, wireless connectivity, and Dolby Atmos® for immersive 3D audio. Featuring detachable wireless surround speakers and a 10-inch subwoofer, this sound system is designed to transform any living room into a cinematic space. With 780W of peak output power, explosive bass, and crystal-clear dialogue, movies, games, and music can be enjoyed with exceptional clarity and depth.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1276\" data-start=\"668\"\u003eSetup is seamless, requiring no extra cables or complicated configurations. Simply detach the wireless speakers from the main soundbar and place them behind you for authentic surround sound. The system is powered by JBL’s renowned audio engineering, delivering rich, balanced sound across all frequencies. Built with Bluetooth 5.3, Wi-Fi, HDMI eARC, and multiple input options, the JBL Bar 800MK2 offers flexible compatibility with TVs, streaming services, and gaming consoles. Long-lasting battery life, Dolby Vision support, and HDR10+ pass-through make this soundbar system a complete entertainment hub.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"1301\" data-start=\"1283\"\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2167\" data-start=\"1302\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1409\" data-start=\"1302\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1409\" data-start=\"1304\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1339\" data-start=\"1304\"\u003eTrue 7.1 Channel Surround Sound\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e– Enjoy immersive audio with detachable wireless surround speakers.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1518\" data-start=\"1410\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1518\" data-start=\"1412\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1437\" data-start=\"1412\"\u003eDolby Atmos® 3D Audio\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e– Experience cinematic sound from every angle with realistic overhead effects.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1624\" data-start=\"1519\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1624\" data-start=\"1521\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1545\" data-start=\"1521\"\u003ePowerful 780W Output\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e– Crisp highs, dynamic mids, and booming bass for movies, music, and gaming.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1700\" data-start=\"1625\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1700\" data-start=\"1627\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1653\" data-start=\"1627\"\u003e10” Wireless Subwoofer\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e– Deep and punchy bass without messy cables.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1798\" data-start=\"1701\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1798\" data-start=\"1703\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1732\" data-start=\"1703\"\u003eMultiBeam™ 3.0 Technology\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e– Creates a wider soundstage for an expansive audio experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1893\" data-start=\"1799\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1893\" data-start=\"1801\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1826\" data-start=\"1801\"\u003eWireless Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e– Bluetooth 5.3 and Wi-Fi ensure easy streaming from any device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1997\" data-start=\"1894\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1997\" data-start=\"1896\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1931\" data-start=\"1896\"\u003eHDR10+ and Dolby Vision Support\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e– Seamless video passthrough for ultra-high-definition viewing.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2100\" data-start=\"1998\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2100\" data-start=\"2000\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2030\" data-start=\"2000\"\u003eDetachable Speaker Battery\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e– Up to 10 hours of playtime for flexible use anywhere in the room.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2167\" data-start=\"2101\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2167\" data-start=\"2103\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2117\" data-start=\"2103\"\u003eEasy Setup\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e– No extra wires or power connections required.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"2194\" data-start=\"2174\"\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2224\" data-start=\"2196\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2222\" data-start=\"2196\"\u003eGeneral Specifications\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2852\" data-start=\"2225\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2254\" data-start=\"2225\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2254\" data-start=\"2227\"\u003eSound system: 7.1 channel\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2297\" data-start=\"2255\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2297\" data-start=\"2257\"\u003ePower supply: 100 - 240V AC, ~ 50\/60Hz\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2349\" data-start=\"2298\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2349\" data-start=\"2300\"\u003eTotal speaker power output (Max. @THD 1%): 780W\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2396\" data-start=\"2350\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2396\" data-start=\"2352\"\u003eSoundbar output power (Max. @THD 1%): 400W\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2453\" data-start=\"2397\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2453\" data-start=\"2399\"\u003eSurround speaker output power (Max. @THD 1%): 2x 40W\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2501\" data-start=\"2454\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2501\" data-start=\"2456\"\u003eSubwoofer output power (Max. @THD 1%): 300W\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2580\" data-start=\"2502\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2580\" data-start=\"2504\"\u003eSoundbar transducer: 6x (44x80)mm racetrack drivers, 2x 1\" (25mm) tweeters\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2644\" data-start=\"2581\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2644\" data-start=\"2583\"\u003eSurround speaker transducer: 2x (44x90)mm racetrack drivers\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2682\" data-start=\"2645\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2682\" data-start=\"2647\"\u003eSubwoofer transducer: 10” (260mm)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2719\" data-start=\"2683\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2719\" data-start=\"2685\"\u003eNetworked standby power: \u0026lt; 2.0 W\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2758\" data-start=\"2720\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2758\" data-start=\"2722\"\u003eOperating temperature: 0°C - 45 °C\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2795\" data-start=\"2759\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2795\" data-start=\"2761\"\u003eLithium battery: 3.635V, 3283mAh\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2852\" data-start=\"2796\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2852\" data-start=\"2798\"\u003eDetachable surround speaker playtime: Up to 10 hours\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2880\" data-start=\"2854\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2878\" data-start=\"2854\"\u003eAudio Specifications\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"3005\" data-start=\"2881\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2924\" data-start=\"2881\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2924\" data-start=\"2883\"\u003eFrequency response: 35Hz - 20kHz (-6dB)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"3005\" data-start=\"2925\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"3005\" data-start=\"2927\"\u003eAudio inputs: Optical, Bluetooth, USB (USB playback available in US version)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"3023\" data-start=\"3007\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"3021\" data-start=\"3007\"\u003eDimensions\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"3654\" data-start=\"3024\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"3106\" data-start=\"3024\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"3106\" data-start=\"3026\"\u003eTotal soundbar dimensions (W x H x D): 1163 x 52 x 128mm \/ 45.8\" x 2.0\" x 5.0\"\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"3182\" data-start=\"3107\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"3182\" data-start=\"3109\"\u003eSoundbar dimensions (W x H x D): 854 x 52 x 128mm \/ 35.6\" x 2.0\" x 5.0\"\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"3271\" data-start=\"3183\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"3271\" data-start=\"3185\"\u003eDetachable surround speaker dimensions (each): 169 x 52 x 128mm \/ 6.7\" x 2.0\" x 5.0\"\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"3352\" data-start=\"3272\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"3352\" data-start=\"3274\"\u003eSubwoofer dimensions (W x H x D): 325 x 400 x 325 mm \/ 12.8\" x 15.7\" x 12.8\"\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"3385\" data-start=\"3353\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"3385\" data-start=\"3355\"\u003eSoundbar weight: 5kg \/ 11lbs\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"3448\" data-start=\"3386\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"3448\" data-start=\"3388\"\u003eDetachable surround speaker weight (each): 0.7kg \/ 1.6 lbs\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"3487\" data-start=\"3449\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"3487\" data-start=\"3451\"\u003eSubwoofer weight: 8.1kg \/ 17.8 lbs\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"3571\" data-start=\"3488\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"3571\" data-start=\"3490\"\u003ePackaging dimensions (W x H x D): 980 x 398 x 495 mm \/ 38.58\" x 15.67\" x 19.49\"\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"3654\" data-start=\"3572\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"3654\" data-start=\"3574\"\u003ePackaging weight: 20.8kg \/ 45.9lbs (EMEA\/UK\/AU\/NZ); 18.08kg \/ 41.4lbs (Others)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"3699\" data-start=\"3656\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"3697\" data-start=\"3656\"\u003eControl and Connection Specifications\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"4397\" data-start=\"3700\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"3720\" data-start=\"3700\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"3720\" data-start=\"3702\"\u003eUSB port: Type A\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"3748\" data-start=\"3721\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"3748\" data-start=\"3723\"\u003eUSB rating: 5V DC, 0.5A\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"3781\" data-start=\"3749\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"3781\" data-start=\"3751\"\u003eSupporting file formats: mp3\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"3847\" data-start=\"3782\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"3847\" data-start=\"3784\"\u003eMP3 codec: MPEG 1 Layer 2\/3, MPEG 2 Layer 3, MPEG 2.5 Layer 3\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"3882\" data-start=\"3848\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"3882\" data-start=\"3850\"\u003eMP3 sampling rate: 16 - 48 kHz\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"3913\" data-start=\"3883\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"3913\" data-start=\"3885\"\u003eMP3 bitrate: 80 - 320 kbps\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"3941\" data-start=\"3914\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"3941\" data-start=\"3916\"\u003eBluetooth version: v5.3\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"3987\" data-start=\"3942\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"3987\" data-start=\"3944\"\u003eBluetooth profiles: A2DP v1.3, AVRCP v1.5\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"4052\" data-start=\"3988\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"4052\" data-start=\"3990\"\u003eBluetooth transmitter frequency range: 2400 MHz – 2483.5 MHz\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"4100\" data-start=\"4053\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"4100\" data-start=\"4055\"\u003eBluetooth transmitter power: \u0026lt;15 dBm (EIRP)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"4159\" data-start=\"4101\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"4159\" data-start=\"4103\"\u003eWi-Fi network: IEEE 802.11 a\/b\/g\/n\/ac\/ax (2.4GHz\/5GHz)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"4208\" data-start=\"4160\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"4208\" data-start=\"4162\"\u003e2.4G Wi-Fi transmitter power: \u0026lt;20 dBm (EIRP)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"4266\" data-start=\"4209\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"4266\" data-start=\"4211\"\u003e5G Wi-Fi transmitter frequency range: 5.15 - 5.825GHz\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"4290\" data-start=\"4267\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"4290\" data-start=\"4269\"\u003eHDMI video input: 1\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"4327\" data-start=\"4291\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"4327\" data-start=\"4293\"\u003eHDMI video output (with eARC): 1\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"4354\" data-start=\"4328\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"4354\" data-start=\"4330\"\u003eHDMI HDCP version: 2.3\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"4397\" data-start=\"4355\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"4397\" data-start=\"4357\"\u003eHDR pass-through: HDR10+, Dolby Vision\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"4423\" data-start=\"4399\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"4421\" data-start=\"4399\"\u003eWhat's in the Box?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"4850\" data-start=\"4424\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"4444\" data-start=\"4424\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"4444\" data-start=\"4426\"\u003e1x Main soundbar\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"4489\" data-start=\"4445\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"4489\" data-start=\"4447\"\u003e2x Detachable wireless surround speakers\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"4515\" data-start=\"4490\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"4515\" data-start=\"4492\"\u003e1x Wireless subwoofer\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"4553\" data-start=\"4516\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"4553\" data-start=\"4518\"\u003eRemote control with 2 x batteries\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"4607\" data-start=\"4554\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"4607\" data-start=\"4556\"\u003ePower cords (up to 6pcs depending on region SKUs)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"4626\" data-start=\"4608\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"4626\" data-start=\"4610\"\u003e1 x HDMI cable\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"4745\" data-start=\"4627\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"4745\" data-start=\"4629\"\u003e2 x L-shape wall-mount bracket (main bar) + 2 x U-shape wall-mount bracket (for surround speakers) kit with screws\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"4763\" data-start=\"4746\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"4763\" data-start=\"4748\"\u003e4 x Side caps\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"4785\" data-start=\"4764\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"4785\" data-start=\"4766\"\u003eQuick start guide\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"4826\" data-start=\"4786\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"4826\" data-start=\"4788\"\u003eSafety instruction and warranty card\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"4850\" data-start=\"4827\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"4850\" data-start=\"4829\"\u003eWall mount template\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"JBL","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47900394979550,"sku":null,"price":680.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/2_b15a7b64-772c-4de0-8c0c-3dda046c8f8d.jpg?v=1771065675"},{"product_id":"jbl-bar-1000mk2-7-1-channel-dolby-atmos®-soundbar","title":"JBL Bar 1000MK2 - 7.1.4 Channel Dolby Atmos® Soundbar System","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eGet real spatial sound with true Dolby Atmos® and DTS:X height effects in seconds with the JBL BAR 1000MK2 soundbar. Take along one of the wireless speakers whenever you step out of the room, and you'll never miss a thing.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"203\" data-end=\"656\"\u003eThe JBL Bar 1000 is designed to transform home entertainment with a cinematic 7.1.4 channel surround sound system. Featuring Dolby Atmos®, DTS:X, and JBL’s MultiBeam™ technology, this premium soundbar creates a 3D audio experience that fills the room with clarity and depth. Two up-firing drivers in the soundbar and two more in the detachable surround speakers ensure powerful, theater-quality sound from every angle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"1137\"\u003eThis soundbar system comes with detachable wireless surround speakers and a 10-inch wireless subwoofer, delivering rich bass and immersive audio without the hassle of additional wires. With built-in Wi-Fi supporting AirPlay, Chromecast, and Alexa Multi-Room Music, users can stream over 300 music services in high-definition. Automatic software updates also keep the system up to date with the latest features, ensuring a future-ready audio setup for movies, music, and gaming.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1162\"\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1893\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1277\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1277\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1191\"\u003eTrue 3D Surround Sound\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e– Dolby Atmos®, DTS:X, and MultiBeam™ technology deliver immersive cinematic sound.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1404\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1280\" data-end=\"1404\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1280\" data-end=\"1321\"\u003eDetachable Wireless Surround Speakers\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e– Battery-powered rear speakers provide real surround sound with easy placement.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1496\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1496\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1437\"\u003ePowerful Audio Performance\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e– 880W of total output power ensures room-filling sound.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1572\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1572\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1521\"\u003eWireless Subwoofer\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e– A 10” subwoofer produces deep and punchy bass.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1679\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1679\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1603\"\u003eBuilt-In Wi-Fi Streaming\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e– Access AirPlay, Chromecast, Alexa MRM, and over 300 streaming services.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1773\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1682\" data-end=\"1773\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1682\" data-end=\"1712\"\u003eAutomatic Software Updates\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e– The system stays up-to-date with new features via Wi-Fi.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1774\" data-end=\"1893\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1893\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1801\"\u003eSeamless Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e– HDMI eARC, Bluetooth 5.3, and multiple HDMI inputs for easy setup with TVs and devices.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1900\" data-end=\"1920\"\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1950\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1948\"\u003eGeneral Specifications\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1951\" data-end=\"2119\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1951\" data-end=\"1970\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"1970\"\u003eModel: BAR 1000\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2002\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1973\" data-end=\"2002\"\u003eSound system: 7.1.4 channel\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2045\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2005\" data-end=\"2045\"\u003ePower supply: 100 - 240V AC, ~ 50\/60Hz\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2081\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2048\" data-end=\"2081\"\u003eNetworked standby power: \u0026lt; 2.0W\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2082\" data-end=\"2119\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2084\" data-end=\"2119\"\u003eOperating temperature: 0°C - 45°C\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2121\" data-end=\"2147\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2121\" data-end=\"2145\"\u003eAudio Specifications\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2787\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2198\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2150\" data-end=\"2198\"\u003eTotal speaker power output (Max @THD 1%): 880W\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2199\" data-end=\"2244\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2201\" data-end=\"2244\"\u003eSoundbar output power (Max @THD 1%): 440W\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2300\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2247\" data-end=\"2300\"\u003eSurround speaker output power (Max @THD 1%): 2x 70W\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2347\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2303\" data-end=\"2347\"\u003eSubwoofer output power (Max @THD 1%): 300W\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2348\" data-end=\"2475\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2475\"\u003eSoundbar transducer: 5x (46x90)mm racetrack drivers, 3x 0.75\" (20mm) tweeters, 2x 2.75\" (70mm) up-firing full-range drivers\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2476\" data-end=\"2573\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2478\" data-end=\"2573\"\u003eSurround speaker transducer: 0.75\" (20mm) tweeters, 2.75\" (70mm) up-firing full-range drivers\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2574\" data-end=\"2611\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2576\" data-end=\"2611\"\u003eSubwoofer transducer: 10” (260mm)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2655\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"2655\"\u003eFrequency response: 33Hz - 20kHz (-6dB)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2656\" data-end=\"2787\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2658\" data-end=\"2787\"\u003eAudio inputs: 1 Optical, Bluetooth, USB (USB playback is available in US version. For other versions, USB is for Service only.)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2789\" data-end=\"2805\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2789\" data-end=\"2803\"\u003eDimensions\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2806\" data-end=\"3309\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2806\" data-end=\"2864\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2808\" data-end=\"2864\"\u003eTotal soundbar: 1194 x 56 x 125 mm \/ 47\" x 2.2\" x 4.9\"\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2865\" data-end=\"2923\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"2923\"\u003eMain soundbar: 884 x 56 x 125 mm \/ 34.8\" x 2.2\" x 4.9\"\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"3003\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2926\" data-end=\"3003\"\u003eDetachable surround speakers (each): 155 x 56 x 125 mm \/ 6.1\" x 2.2\" x 4.9\"\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3004\" data-end=\"3059\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3006\" data-end=\"3059\"\u003eSubwoofer: 305 x 440.4 x 305 mm \/ 12\" x 17.3\" x 12\"\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3060\" data-end=\"3097\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3062\" data-end=\"3097\"\u003eSoundbar weight: 3.7 kg \/ 8.2 lbs\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3098\" data-end=\"3161\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3100\" data-end=\"3161\"\u003eDetachable surround speaker weight (each): 1.4 kg \/ 3.1 lbs\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3162\" data-end=\"3198\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3164\" data-end=\"3198\"\u003eSubwoofer weight: 10 kg \/ 22 lbs\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3199\" data-end=\"3268\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3201\" data-end=\"3268\"\u003ePackaging dimensions: 1000 x 375 x 475 mm \/ 39.4\" x 14.8\" x 18.7\"\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3269\" data-end=\"3309\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3271\" data-end=\"3309\"\u003ePackaging weight: 19.4 kg \/ 42.7 lbs\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3311\" data-end=\"3354\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"3311\" data-end=\"3352\"\u003eControl and Connection Specifications\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"3355\" data-end=\"4201\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3355\" data-end=\"3375\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3357\" data-end=\"3375\"\u003eUSB port: Type A\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3376\" data-end=\"3403\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3378\" data-end=\"3403\"\u003eUSB rating: 5V DC, 0.5A\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3404\" data-end=\"3435\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3406\" data-end=\"3435\"\u003eSupporting file format: MP3\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3436\" data-end=\"3501\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3438\" data-end=\"3501\"\u003eMP3 codec: MPEG 1 Layer 2\/3, MPEG 2 Layer 3, MPEG 2.5 Layer 3\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3502\" data-end=\"3536\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3504\" data-end=\"3536\"\u003eMP3 sampling rate: 16 - 48 kHz\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3537\" data-end=\"3567\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3539\" data-end=\"3567\"\u003eMP3 bitrate: 80 - 320 kbps\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3568\" data-end=\"3594\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3570\" data-end=\"3594\"\u003eBluetooth version: 5.3\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3595\" data-end=\"3637\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3597\" data-end=\"3637\"\u003eBluetooth profile: A2DP 1.2, AVRCP 1.5\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3638\" data-end=\"3700\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3640\" data-end=\"3700\"\u003eBluetooth transmitter frequency range: 2400MHz – 2483.5MHz\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3701\" data-end=\"3747\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3703\" data-end=\"3747\"\u003eBluetooth transmitter power: \u0026lt;15dBm (EIRP)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3748\" data-end=\"3806\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3750\" data-end=\"3806\"\u003eWi-Fi network: IEEE 802.11 a\/b\/g\/n\/ac\/ax (2.4GHz\/5GHz)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3807\" data-end=\"3847\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3809\" data-end=\"3847\"\u003e2.4G Wi-Fi frequency: 2412 - 2472MHz\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3848\" data-end=\"3884\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3850\" data-end=\"3884\"\u003e2.4G Wi-Fi power: \u0026lt; 20dBm (EIRP)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3885\" data-end=\"3959\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3887\" data-end=\"3959\"\u003e5G Wi-Fi frequency: 5.15 - 5.35GHz, 5.470 - 5.725GHz, 5.725 - 5.825GHz\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3960\" data-end=\"4066\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3962\" data-end=\"4066\"\u003e5G Wi-Fi power: 5.15-5.25GHz \u0026lt;23dBm, 5.25-5.35GHz \u0026amp; 5.47-5.725GHz \u0026lt;20dBm, 5.725-5.825GHz \u0026lt;14dBm (EIRP)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4067\" data-end=\"4116\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4069\" data-end=\"4116\"\u003e2.4G wireless frequency range: 2406 - 2474MHz\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4117\" data-end=\"4155\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4119\" data-end=\"4155\"\u003e2.4G wireless power: \u0026lt;10dBm (EIRP)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4156\" data-end=\"4201\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4158\" data-end=\"4201\"\u003eBattery: Lithium battery, 3.635V, 3283mAh\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4203\" data-end=\"4229\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"4203\" data-end=\"4227\"\u003eVideo Specifications\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"4230\" data-end=\"4359\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4230\" data-end=\"4253\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4232\" data-end=\"4253\"\u003eHDMI video input: 3\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4254\" data-end=\"4290\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4256\" data-end=\"4290\"\u003eHDMI video output (with eARC): 1\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4291\" data-end=\"4317\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4293\" data-end=\"4317\"\u003eHDMI HDCP version: 2.3\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4318\" data-end=\"4359\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4320\" data-end=\"4359\"\u003eHDR pass-through: HDR10, Dolby Vision\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4361\" data-end=\"4384\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"4361\" data-end=\"4382\"\u003eWhat's in The Box\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"4385\" data-end=\"4804\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4385\" data-end=\"4405\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4387\" data-end=\"4405\"\u003e1x Main soundbar\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4406\" data-end=\"4450\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4408\" data-end=\"4450\"\u003e2x Detachable wireless surround speakers\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4451\" data-end=\"4476\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4453\" data-end=\"4476\"\u003e1x Wireless subwoofer\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4477\" data-end=\"4513\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4479\" data-end=\"4513\"\u003eRemote control with 2x batteries\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4514\" data-end=\"4567\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4516\" data-end=\"4567\"\u003ePower cords (up to 8pcs depending on region SKUs)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4568\" data-end=\"4585\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4570\" data-end=\"4585\"\u003e1x HDMI cable\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4586\" data-end=\"4700\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4588\" data-end=\"4700\"\u003e2x L-shape wall-mount brackets (main bar) + 2x U-shape wall-mount brackets (surround speakers) kit with screws\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4701\" data-end=\"4717\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4703\" data-end=\"4717\"\u003e4x Side caps\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4718\" data-end=\"4739\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4720\" data-end=\"4739\"\u003eQuick start guide\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4740\" data-end=\"4780\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4742\" data-end=\"4780\"\u003eSafety instruction and Warranty card\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4781\" data-end=\"4804\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4783\" data-end=\"4804\"\u003eWall mount template\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"JBL","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47900411265246,"sku":null,"price":850.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/square-image_23b9ca03-a37f-47c1-8b5d-8f61f338ebc9.jpg?v=1771065433"},{"product_id":"jbl-bar-500mk2-5-1-channel-dolby-atmos®-soundbar-system","title":"JBL Bar 500MK2 - 5.1 Channel Dolby Atmos® Soundbar System","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"152\" data-end=\"644\"\u003eAn immersive home theater experience is delivered with the JBL Bar 500MK2, designed to transform everyday TV viewing into powerful cinematic sound. Rich, room-filling audio is produced through a 5.1-channel system that combines advanced surround technologies with precise sound tuning. Crystal-clear dialogue is ensured, while a wide and detailed soundstage is created to enhance movies, series, sports, and gaming across any TV brand.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"1120\"\u003eDeeper impact is added through a 10\" wireless subwoofer, where low frequencies are reproduced with authority and clarity. Explosive action scenes, atmospheric soundtracks, and dynamic music playback are experienced with greater intensity thanks to a total system output of up to 750W. With support for Dolby Atmos® and DTS Virtual:X®, three-dimensional sound is projected throughout the room, creating a sense of movement and height without the need for additional speakers.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1153\"\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1466\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1199\"\u003eDolby Atmos® and DTS Virtual:X® 3D Sound\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1202\"\u003eTrue cinematic immersion is achieved as sound is virtually positioned around and above the listener. Overhead effects, spatial movement, and environmental detail are reproduced to create a realistic three-dimensional audio experience from a single soundbar system.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1777\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1523\"\u003e750W Total System Power with 10\" Wireless Subwoofer\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1526\"\u003eHigh output performance is delivered for impactful sound reproduction. Powerful bass is produced by the large wireless subwoofer, while the soundbar handles mids and highs with clarity, resulting in balanced and dynamic audio across all content types.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"2031\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"1813\"\u003eMultiBeam™ 3.0 Wide Soundstage\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1816\"\u003eA cinema-like sound field is created by precisely directed sound beams. Regardless of seating position, audio is evenly distributed throughout the room, ensuring consistent immersion and lifelike sound reproduction.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2033\" data-end=\"2292\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2033\" data-end=\"2087\"\u003eUniversal TV Compatibility and Modern Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"2087\" data-end=\"2090\"\u003eSeamless operation is ensured with virtually any TV brand. HDMI eARC, Bluetooth 5.3, Wi-Fi, and optical inputs are provided for flexible connections, easy streaming, and high-quality audio transmission.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-start=\"2299\" data-end=\"2316\"\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2344\"\u003eGeneral Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2874\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2420\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2347\" data-end=\"2420\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2347\" data-end=\"2357\"\u003eModel:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eBAR 500MK2 (soundbar unit) \/ BAR 500MK2 SUB (subwoofer unit)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2421\" data-end=\"2454\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2423\" data-end=\"2454\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2423\" data-end=\"2440\"\u003eSound system:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e5.1 channel\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2455\" data-end=\"2501\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2457\" data-end=\"2501\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2457\" data-end=\"2474\"\u003ePower supply:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e100 - 240V AC, ~ 50\/60Hz\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2502\" data-end=\"2558\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2504\" data-end=\"2558\"\u003e\u003cem data-start=\"2504\" data-end=\"2550\"\u003e\u003cem data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2533\"\u003eTotal speaker power output\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e(Max. @THD 1%):\u003c\/em\u003e* 750W\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2609\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2561\" data-end=\"2609\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2561\" data-end=\"2586\"\u003eSoundbar output power\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e(Max. @THD 1%): 450W\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2610\" data-end=\"2662\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2662\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2638\"\u003eSubwoofer output power\u003c\/strong\u003e* (Max. @THD 1%): 300W\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2663\" data-end=\"2748\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2748\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2689\"\u003eSoundbar transducer:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e5x (42x80)mm racetrack drivers, 4x 0.75\" (20mm) tweeters\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2749\" data-end=\"2790\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2751\" data-end=\"2790\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2751\" data-end=\"2776\"\u003eSubwoofer transducer:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e10” (260mm)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"2831\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2793\" data-end=\"2831\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2793\" data-end=\"2821\"\u003eNetworked standby power:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u0026lt; 2.0 W\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2832\" data-end=\"2874\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2834\" data-end=\"2874\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2834\" data-end=\"2860\"\u003eOperating temperature:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e0°C - 45 °C\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"2876\" data-end=\"2900\"\u003eAudio Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2901\" data-end=\"3080\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2901\" data-end=\"2948\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2903\" data-end=\"2948\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2903\" data-end=\"2926\"\u003eFrequency response:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e40Hz - 20kHz (-6dB)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2949\" data-end=\"3080\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2951\" data-end=\"3080\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2951\" data-end=\"2968\"\u003eAudio inputs:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eOptical, Bluetooth, USB (USB playback is available in US version. For other versions, USB is for Service only.)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"3082\" data-end=\"3096\"\u003eDimensions\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"3097\" data-end=\"3267\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3097\" data-end=\"3182\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3099\" data-end=\"3182\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"3099\" data-end=\"3140\"\u003eMain soundbar dimensions (W x H x D):\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e940 x 50.5 x 104 mm \/ 37\" x 2.0\" x 4.1\"\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3183\" data-end=\"3267\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3185\" data-end=\"3267\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"3185\" data-end=\"3222\"\u003eSubwoofer dimensions (W x H x D):\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e325 x 400 x 325 mm \/ 12.8\" x 15.7\" x 12.8\"\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"3269\" data-end=\"3279\"\u003eWeight\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"3280\" data-end=\"3363\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3280\" data-end=\"3319\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3282\" data-end=\"3319\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"3282\" data-end=\"3302\"\u003eSoundbar weight:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e2.9kg \/ 6.5lbs\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3320\" data-end=\"3363\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3322\" data-end=\"3363\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"3322\" data-end=\"3343\"\u003eSubwoofer weight:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e8.1 kg \/ 17.8 lbs\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"3365\" data-end=\"3378\"\u003ePackaging\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"3379\" data-end=\"3551\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3379\" data-end=\"3464\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3381\" data-end=\"3464\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"3381\" data-end=\"3418\"\u003ePackaging dimensions (W x H x D):\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e1020 x 395 x 490 mm \/ 40.2\" x 15.6\" x 19.3\"\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3465\" data-end=\"3551\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3467\" data-end=\"3551\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"3467\" data-end=\"3488\"\u003ePackaging Weight:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e18.0kg \/ 39.7lbs (EMEA\/UK\/AU\/NZ) \/ 15.9kg \/ 34.9lbs (Others)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3553\" data-end=\"3616\"\u003e* RMS @THD 1%\u003cbr data-start=\"3567\" data-end=\"3570\"\u003e** RMS @THD 1% 225W\u003cbr data-start=\"3590\" data-end=\"3593\"\u003e*** RMS @THD 1% 375W\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"3618\" data-end=\"3659\"\u003eControl and Connection Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"3660\" data-end=\"3978\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3660\" data-end=\"3684\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3662\" data-end=\"3684\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"3662\" data-end=\"3675\"\u003eUSB port:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eType A\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3685\" data-end=\"3716\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3687\" data-end=\"3716\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"3687\" data-end=\"3702\"\u003eUSB rating:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e5V DC, 0.5A\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3717\" data-end=\"3753\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3719\" data-end=\"3753\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"3719\" data-end=\"3747\"\u003eSupporting file formats:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003emp3\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3754\" data-end=\"3823\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3756\" data-end=\"3823\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"3756\" data-end=\"3770\"\u003eMP3 codec:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eMPEG 1 Layer 2\/3, MPEG 2 Layer 3, MPEG 2.5 Layer 3\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3824\" data-end=\"3862\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3826\" data-end=\"3862\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"3826\" data-end=\"3848\"\u003eMP3 sampling rate:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e16 - 48 kHz\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3863\" data-end=\"3897\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3865\" data-end=\"3897\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"3865\" data-end=\"3881\"\u003eMP3 bitrate:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e80 - 320 kbps\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3898\" data-end=\"3929\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3900\" data-end=\"3929\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"3900\" data-end=\"3922\"\u003eBluetooth version:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003ev5.3\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3930\" data-end=\"3978\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3932\" data-end=\"3978\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"3932\" data-end=\"3954\"\u003eBluetooth profile:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eA2DP v1.3, AVRCP v1.5\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"3980\" data-end=\"4005\"\u003eWireless Connectivity\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"4006\" data-end=\"4552\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4006\" data-end=\"4068\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4008\" data-end=\"4068\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"4008\" data-end=\"4026\"\u003eWi-Fi network:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eIEEE 802.11 a\/b\/g\/n\/ac\/ax (2.4GHz\/5GHz)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4069\" data-end=\"4132\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4071\" data-end=\"4132\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"4071\" data-end=\"4114\"\u003e2.4G Wi-Fi transmitter frequency range:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e2412 - 2472 MHz\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4133\" data-end=\"4186\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4135\" data-end=\"4186\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"4135\" data-end=\"4168\"\u003e2.4G Wi-Fi transmitter power:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u0026lt; 20 dBm (EIRP)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4187\" data-end=\"4283\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4189\" data-end=\"4283\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"4189\" data-end=\"4230\"\u003e5G Wi-Fi transmitter frequency range:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e5.15 - 5.35GHz, 5.470 - 5.725GHz, 5.725 - 5.825GHz\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4284\" data-end=\"4431\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4286\" data-end=\"4319\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"4286\" data-end=\"4317\"\u003e5G Wi-Fi transmitter power:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"4322\" data-end=\"4431\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4322\" data-end=\"4347\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4324\" data-end=\"4347\"\u003e5.15 - 5.25GHz \u0026lt;23dBm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4350\" data-end=\"4394\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4352\" data-end=\"4394\"\u003e5.25 - 5.35GHz \u0026amp; 5.470 - 5.725GHz \u0026lt;20dBm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4397\" data-end=\"4431\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4399\" data-end=\"4431\"\u003e5.725 - 5.825GHz \u0026lt;14dBm (EIRP)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4432\" data-end=\"4497\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4434\" data-end=\"4497\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"4434\" data-end=\"4480\"\u003e2.4G wireless transmitter frequency range:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e2406 - 2474MHz\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4498\" data-end=\"4552\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4500\" data-end=\"4552\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"4500\" data-end=\"4536\"\u003e2.4G wireless transmitter power:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u0026lt;10dBm (EIRP)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4554\" data-end=\"4636\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"4554\" data-end=\"4563\"\u003eNote:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eBand 5.6 - 5.64 GHz is disabled when shipped to Australia \/ New Zealand.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"4638\" data-end=\"4662\"\u003eVideo Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"4663\" data-end=\"4804\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4663\" data-end=\"4690\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4665\" data-end=\"4690\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"4665\" data-end=\"4686\"\u003eHDMI video input:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e1\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4691\" data-end=\"4726\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4693\" data-end=\"4726\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"4693\" data-end=\"4722\"\u003eHDMI video output (eARC):\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e1\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4727\" data-end=\"4757\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4729\" data-end=\"4757\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"4729\" data-end=\"4751\"\u003eHDMI HDCP version:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e2.3\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4758\" data-end=\"4804\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4760\" data-end=\"4804\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"4760\" data-end=\"4781\"\u003eHDR pass through:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eHDR10+, Dolby Vision\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"4806\" data-end=\"4827\"\u003eWhat’s in the Box\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"4828\" data-end=\"5118\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4828\" data-end=\"4848\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4830\" data-end=\"4848\"\u003e1x Main soundbar\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4849\" data-end=\"4874\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4851\" data-end=\"4874\"\u003e1x Wireless subwoofer\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4875\" data-end=\"4912\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4877\" data-end=\"4912\"\u003eRemote control with 2 x batteries\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4913\" data-end=\"4966\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4915\" data-end=\"4966\"\u003ePower cords (up to 6pcs depending on region SKUs)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4967\" data-end=\"4985\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4969\" data-end=\"4985\"\u003e1 x HDMI cable\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"4986\" data-end=\"5031\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"4988\" data-end=\"5031\"\u003e2 x L-shape wall-mount bracket (main bar)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"5032\" data-end=\"5053\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"5034\" data-end=\"5053\"\u003eQuick start guide\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"5054\" data-end=\"5094\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"5056\" data-end=\"5094\"\u003eSafety instruction and Warranty card\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"5095\" data-end=\"5118\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"5097\" data-end=\"5118\"\u003eWall mount template\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"JBL","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47900499771614,"sku":null,"price":500.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/square-image_1_b60f50ec-74b8-4a8b-88aa-83aea8bc9f3f.jpg?v=1771068109"},{"product_id":"jbl-bar-2-1-deep-bass-mk2-2-1-channel-soundbar-system-with-wireless-subwoofer","title":"JBL Bar 2.1 Deep Bass (MK2) - 2.1 Channel Soundbar System with Wireless Subwoofer","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home entertainment with the JBL Bar 2.1 Deep Bass (MK2) soundbar system. This compact yet powerful soundbar delivers an impressive 300 watts of JBL's signature sound, providing an immersive audio experience that enhances movies, music, and gaming. The system features a robust 2.1 channel configuration, including a wireless subwoofer designed to produce deep, resonant bass. With its sleek design, the JBL Bar 2.1 seamlessly fits into any home setup while elevating your audio experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEquipped with a range of connectivity options, including optical and HDMI inputs, as well as built-in Bluetooth for wireless streaming, this soundbar offers flexibility and ease of use. The inclusion of Dolby Digital and JBL Surround Sound technologies ensures that your entertainment is delivered with cinematic quality, making every moment more engaging and thrilling. Whether you're watching the latest blockbuster or listening to your favorite playlist, the JBL Bar 2.1 Deep Bass (MK2) promises to enhance your audio experience with powerful, clear sound.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePowerful Sound Output\u003c\/strong\u003e: Provides a total of 300 watts with 2x 50 watts from the soundbar and 200 watts from the subwoofer, delivering rich and immersive audio.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAdvanced Transducers\u003c\/strong\u003e: Features 4 race-track drivers and 2x 1” tweeters in the soundbar, coupled with a 6.5” subwoofer for deep, impactful bass.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity Options\u003c\/strong\u003e: Includes one optical input, Bluetooth for wireless streaming, and a USB port for easy connection to various devices.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDolby Digital and JBL Surround Sound\u003c\/strong\u003e: Enhances your audio experience with cinematic sound quality, making movies and music more engaging.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCompact Design\u003c\/strong\u003e: The soundbar and subwoofer are designed to fit seamlessly into any home entertainment setup without compromising on performance.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGeneral Specifications\u003c\/strong\u003e:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePower Supply: 100 - 240V AC, ~ 50\/60Hz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOperating Temperature: 0°C - 45°C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAudio Specifications\u003c\/strong\u003e:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTotal Speaker Power Output (Max. @ THD 1%): 300W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOutput Power (Max. @ THD 1%): 2 x 50W (Soundbar), 200W (Subwoofer)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTransducer: 4 x race-track drivers + 2 x 1” tweeters (Soundbar), 6.5” (Subwoofer)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSoundbar and Subwoofer Standby Power: \u0026lt;0.5W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFrequency Response: 40Hz - 20KHz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAudio Inputs: 1 Optical, Bluetooth, USB (USB playback is available in US version; for other versions, USB is for service only.)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDimensions\u003c\/strong\u003e:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSoundbar Dimensions (W x H x D): 965 x 56 x 85 mm \/ 38” x 2.2” x 3.4”\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSubwoofer Dimensions (W x H x D): 240 x 240 x 379 mm \/ 8.9” x 8.9” x 14.6”\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWeight\u003c\/strong\u003e:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSoundbar Weight: 2.14 kg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSubwoofer Weight: 5.61 kg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePackaging Dimensions (W x H x D): 1045 x 310 x 405 mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePackaging Weight (Gross Weight): 10.32 kg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eControl and Connection Specifications\u003c\/strong\u003e:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUSB Port: Type A\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUSB Rating: 5V DC\/ 0.5A\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSupporting File Format: MP3, WAV\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMP3 Codec: MPEG 1 Layer 2\/3, MPEG 2 Layer 3, MPEG 2.5 Layer 3\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMP3 Sampling Rate: 16 kHz - 48 kHz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMP3 Bitrate: 80 kbps - 320 kbps\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWAV Sample Rate: 16 kHz - 48 kHz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWAV Bitrate: Up to 3000 kbps\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Version: 4.2\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Profile: A2DP V1.3, AVRCP V1.5\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Frequency Range: 2402 MHz - 2480 MHz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Max. Transmitting Power: \u0026lt;10 dBm (EIRP)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eModulation Type: GFSK, π\/4 DQPSK, 8DPSK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e5G Wireless Frequency Range: 5736.35 - 5820.35 MHz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e5G Max. Transmitting Power: \u0026lt;9 dBm (EIRP)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eModulation Type: π\/4 DQPSK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"JBL","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47900547285214,"sku":null,"price":300.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/square-image_1_d7b19759-d18f-4a19-92a2-3569ada4b472.jpg?v=1771069835"},{"product_id":"jbl-cinema-sb580-3-1-channel-dolby-atmos®-soundbar-system","title":"JBL Cinema SB580 - 3.1 Channel Dolby Atmos® Sound bar System","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"144\" data-end=\"646\"\u003eTransform your home entertainment with the \u003cstrong data-start=\"187\" data-end=\"207\"\u003eJBL Cinema SB580\u003c\/strong\u003e soundbar system. Designed to bring cinematic sound into any living space, this powerful 3.1‑channel system delivers an impressive \u003cstrong data-start=\"338\" data-end=\"376\"\u003e440 watts of JBL’s signature audio\u003c\/strong\u003e, providing immersive sound that enhances movies, music, and TV shows. With a dedicated center channel for crystal‑clear dialogue and a wireless subwoofer for deep bass, this system elevates your listening experience to new heights. \u003cspan class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"1154\"\u003eThe sleek, modern design of the JBL Cinema SB580 ensures it fits seamlessly into your home setup while delivering room‑filling audio performance. Featuring \u003cstrong data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"828\"\u003eVirtual Dolby Atmos®\u003c\/strong\u003e technology, it creates a sense of sound coming from all around you, bringing greater depth and realism to your entertainment. With multiple connectivity options including HDMI, optical input, and Bluetooth streaming, this soundbar offers flexibility and convenience for all your devices. \u003cspan class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1175\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1173\"\u003eKey Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"2030\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1383\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1383\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1204\"\u003ePowerful Sound Output:\u003c\/strong\u003e Delivers up to \u003cstrong data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1251\"\u003e440 W of total system power\u003c\/strong\u003e with 240 W from the soundbar and 200 W from the wireless subwoofer for rich, dynamic audio. \u003cspan class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1545\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1545\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1416\"\u003e3.1‑Channel Configuration:\u003c\/strong\u003e Includes a dedicated center channel for enhanced dialogue clarity and a wide soundstage. \u003cspan class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1700\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1700\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1573\"\u003eVirtual Dolby Atmos®:\u003c\/strong\u003e Provides a more immersive audio experience with simulated height and surround effects. \u003cspan class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1701\" data-end=\"1833\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1833\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1726\"\u003eWireless Subwoofer:\u003c\/strong\u003e 6.5″ subwoofer delivers deep, powerful bass without cable clutter. \u003cspan class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1834\" data-end=\"2030\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1836\" data-end=\"2030\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1836\" data-end=\"1862\"\u003eFlexible Connectivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e HDMI (including eARC), optical input, USB, and Bluetooth support make connecting TVs, gaming consoles, and mobile devices easy. \u003cspan class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2053\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2051\"\u003eSpecifications:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2084\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2082\"\u003eGeneral Specifications:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2633\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2156\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2087\" data-end=\"2156\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2087\" data-end=\"2104\"\u003eSound System:\u003c\/strong\u003e 3.1 channel \u003cspan class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2251\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2251\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2205\"\u003eTotal Speaker Power Output (Max @ THD 1%):\u003c\/strong\u003e 440 W \u003cspan class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2252\" data-end=\"2343\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2254\" data-end=\"2343\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2254\" data-end=\"2295\"\u003eSoundbar Output Power (Max @ THD 1%):\u003c\/strong\u003e 240 W \u003cspan class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2344\" data-end=\"2436\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2436\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2388\"\u003eSubwoofer Output Power (Max @ THD 1%):\u003c\/strong\u003e 200 W \u003cspan class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2539\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2439\" data-end=\"2539\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2439\" data-end=\"2464\"\u003eSoundbar Transducers:\u003c\/strong\u003e 3 racetrack drivers + 3 tweeters \u003cspan class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2540\" data-end=\"2633\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2542\" data-end=\"2633\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2542\" data-end=\"2567\"\u003eSubwoofer Transducer:\u003c\/strong\u003e 6.5″ wireless subwoofer \u003cspan class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2635\" data-end=\"2662\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2635\" data-end=\"2660\"\u003eAudio \u0026amp; Connectivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2663\" data-end=\"2950\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2663\" data-end=\"2745\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2745\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2688\"\u003eFrequency Response:\u003c\/strong\u003e 40 Hz – 20 kHz \u003cspan class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2746\" data-end=\"2868\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2748\" data-end=\"2868\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2748\" data-end=\"2759\"\u003eInputs:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1 Optical, Bluetooth, USB (playback availability varies by region) \u003cspan class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2869\" data-end=\"2950\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2871\" data-end=\"2950\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2871\" data-end=\"2880\"\u003eHDMI:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1 Input, 1 Output with eARC \u003cspan class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2952\" data-end=\"2978\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2952\" data-end=\"2976\"\u003eDimensions \u0026amp; Weight:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2979\" data-end=\"3278\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2979\" data-end=\"3053\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2981\" data-end=\"3053\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2981\" data-end=\"2994\"\u003eSoundbar:\u003c\/strong\u003e 950 × 64 × 80 mm \u003cspan class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3054\" data-end=\"3131\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3056\" data-end=\"3131\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"3056\" data-end=\"3070\"\u003eSubwoofer:\u003c\/strong\u003e 200 × 404 × 250 mm \u003cspan class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3132\" data-end=\"3204\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3134\" data-end=\"3204\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"3134\" data-end=\"3154\"\u003eSoundbar Weight:\u003c\/strong\u003e ~2.6 kg \u003cspan class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3205\" data-end=\"3278\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3207\" data-end=\"3278\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"3207\" data-end=\"3228\"\u003eSubwoofer Weight:\u003c\/strong\u003e ~5.7 kg\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"JBL","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47900743467230,"sku":null,"price":320.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/square-image_14.jpg?v=1771070600"},{"product_id":"jbl-boombox4-1","title":"JBL BoomBox4 Portable Speaker","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe JBL Boombox 4 brings the boom wherever we go. It’s portable, waterproof, and dustproof—so we never stress about weather or spills. We get massive JBL Pro Sound with a Bass Boost that lets us pick between deep or punchy bass, depending on the vibe. Boombox 4 boasts bigger sound than ever before, lighter for easier carry, and up to 34 hours of playtime on a single charge.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-hveid=\"CAEIABAG\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" class=\"Y3BBE\"\u003e\u003cstrong class=\"Yjhzub\"\u003eKey Features and Upgrades:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-hveid=\"CAEIABAG\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" class=\"Y3BBE\"\u003e\u003cspan data-sfc-cp=\"\" class=\"T286Pc\"\u003e\u003cstrong class=\"Yjhzub\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-hveid=\"CAEIABAG\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" class=\"Y3BBE\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-sfc-cp=\"\" class=\"T286Pc\"\u003e\u003cstrong class=\"Yjhzub\"\u003eAudio Performance:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eDelivers \"violent\" sound with powerful bass (40-20 Hz range) and two, or sometimes three, passive radiators. It includes AI Sound Boost for real-time optimization and two bass modes.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"KsbFXc U6u95\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-hveid=\"CAEIABAJ\"\u003e\n\u003cspan data-sfc-cp=\"\" class=\"T286Pc\"\u003e\u003cstrong class=\"Yjhzub\"\u003eBattery \u0026amp; Power:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eUp to 34 hours (with stamina mode) or ~10 hours at high volume\/heavy bass\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"sdh_aXuQadDLB5yK9u8Py9jU4As_1\"\u003e. The battery is user-replaceable and supports fast charging\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"sdh_aXuQadDLB5yK9u8Py9jU4As_2\"\u003e.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"sdh_aXuQadDLB5yK9u8Py9jU4As_3\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-sfc-cp=\"\" class=\"T286Pc\"\u003e\u003cstrong class=\"Yjhzub\"\u003eDurability \u0026amp; Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eFeatures an IP68 rating, making it fully dustproof and waterproof. It is slightly lighter than the Boombox 3 and features a, or sometimes no, redesigned, more comfortable, sometimes plastic, handle.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"sdh_aXuQadDLB5yK9u8Py9jU4As_4\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-sfc-cp=\"\" class=\"T286Pc\"\u003e\u003cstrong class=\"Yjhzub\"\u003eConnectivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eUses Bluetooth 5.4 and features Auracast for pairing with other new JBL models, replacing PartyBoost.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"sdh_aXuQadDLB5yK9u8Py9jU4As_5\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-sfc-cp=\"\" class=\"T286Pc\"\u003e\u003cstrong class=\"Yjhzub\"\u003eFunctionality:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eIncludes a USB-C port for device charging and high-quality audio input.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cspan data-wiz-uids=\"WKjcMc_4r,WKjcMc_4s\" class=\"uJ19be notranslate\"\u003e\u003cspan data-wiz-attrbind=\"class=WKjcMc_4q\/TKHnVd\" data-animation-atomic=\"\" class=\"vKEkVd\"\u003e\u003cspan aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"JBL","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47900864872670,"sku":null,"price":450.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/square-image_30cd3e82-186f-4651-925a-73662e69a078.jpg?v=1771074566"},{"product_id":"jbl-clip5-portable-bluetooth-speaker","title":"JBL Clip5 Portable Bluetooth Speaker","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eDon't let its little size fool you. The JBL Clip 5 packs a serious musical punch, delivering big JBL Pro Sound with punchy bass. Your friends won't believe how much great JBL Pro Sound comes out of such a small speaker.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e The redesigned and fully integrated carabiner has a much wider opening that makes it even more portable. You can attach the Clip 5 to everything from your backpack to your belt loop, and take your music with you all day, everywhere.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eUp to 12 hours of playtime plus 3 hours with Playtime Boost! Don't sweat the small stuff—like charging your battery. JBL Clip 5 gives you up to 12 hours of playtime on a single charge. Tap Playtime Boost to add up to 3 more hours to your battery life.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eWaterproof and dustproof! The JBL Clip 5's IP67 waterproof and dustproof rating ensures this portable speaker can handle almost any environment, from a poolside party to a seaside picnic.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eWant even bigger JBL Pro Sound? Pair two Clip 5s for stereo sound, or wirelessly connect multiple JBL Auracast-enabled speakers using Auracast for even bigger sound.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"JBL","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":47903682625758,"sku":null,"price":50.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":47903682658526,"sku":null,"price":50.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Camo","offer_id":47903682691294,"sku":null,"price":50.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Purple","offer_id":47903682724062,"sku":null,"price":50.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Pink","offer_id":47903682756830,"sku":null,"price":50.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false},{"title":"Red","offer_id":47903682789598,"sku":null,"price":50.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/JBL-Clip-5.jpg?v=1771232678"},{"product_id":"jbl-charge-6-portable-bluetooth-speaker","title":"JBL Charge 6 Portable Bluetooth Speaker","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"64\" data-end=\"80\"\u003eJBL Charge 6\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is built to \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"93\" data-end=\"117\"\u003efuel your adventures\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e with \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"123\" data-end=\"175\"\u003emassive sound, deep bass, and extreme durability\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Whether it’s a \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"192\" data-end=\"239\"\u003ebeach party, road trip, or backyard hangout\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, this speaker keeps the energy going strong!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"\" data-start=\"288\" data-end=\"309\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/www.jbl.com\/dw\/image\/v2\/BFND_PRD\/on\/demandware.static\/-\/Sites-masterCatalog_Harman\/default\/dwc32e8ff0\/pdp\/JBL_Charge_6_Lifestyle_01_904x560px.png?sw=904\u0026amp;sh=560\" alt=\"JBL Charge 6 Powerful JBL Pro Sound with AI Sound Boost - Image\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"\" data-start=\"288\" data-end=\"309\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"290\" data-end=\"307\"\u003eKey Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"314\" data-end=\"352\"\u003eSurprisingly Rich \u0026amp; Powerful Sound\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e– Proprietary\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"367\" data-end=\"385\"\u003eAI Sound Boost\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eanalyzes your music in\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"409\" data-end=\"422\"\u003ereal-time\u003c\/strong\u003e, optimizing\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"453\"\u003ebass \u0026amp; clarity\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003ewith\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"481\"\u003eminimal distortion\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"518\"\u003eUp to 28 Hours of Playtime\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e – \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"552\"\u003e24 hours on a single charge\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, plus an extra \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"603\"\u003e4 hours with JBL Playtime Boost\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e for those unforgettable moments.\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"681\"\u003eAuracast Multi-Speaker Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – \u003cstrong data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"714\"\u003ePair two Charge 6 speakers\u003c\/strong\u003e for \u003cstrong data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"735\"\u003estereo sound\u003c\/strong\u003e, or \u003cstrong data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"790\"\u003econnect multiple JBL Auracast-enabled speakers\u003c\/strong\u003e for a \u003cstrong data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"825\"\u003emassive sound experience\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"879\"\u003eIP68 Waterproof, Dustproof \u0026amp; Drop-Resistant\u003c\/strong\u003e – Built to handle \u003cstrong data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"917\"\u003eany environment\u003c\/strong\u003e, even surviving a \u003cstrong data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"964\"\u003e1-meter drop on concrete\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"994\"\u003eSturdy Handle Strap\u003c\/strong\u003e – Take your tunes anywhere with a \u003cstrong data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1055\"\u003eremovable handle strap\u003c\/strong\u003e, perfect for \u003cstrong data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1096\"\u003eeasy carrying on the go\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"JBL Charge 6 Up to 28 hours of playtime - Image\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jbl.com\/dw\/image\/v2\/BFND_PRD\/on\/demandware.static\/-\/Sites-masterCatalog_Harman\/default\/dwfa234625\/pdp\/LS_JBL_Charge_6_Lifestyle_02_904x560px.png?sw=904\u0026amp;sh=560\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1140\"\u003eMore Bass. More Power. More Fun.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"JBL","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":47903715426526,"sku":null,"price":130.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":47903715459294,"sku":null,"price":130.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Squad","offer_id":47903715492062,"sku":null,"price":130.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Purple","offer_id":47903715524830,"sku":null,"price":130.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Red","offer_id":47903715557598,"sku":null,"price":130.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/JBLCHARGE6BLK3_bfa1c962-2d90-46a3-9186-3a67931d0e13.webp?v=1771234600"},{"product_id":"moxom-4k-full-hd-display-1-8m-type-c-to-hdmi-cable-for-monitor-projector-and-tv-4k-hd","title":"MOXOM 4K Full HD Display 1.8m Type-C to HDMI Cable for Monitor, Projector, Laptops, Mobiles and TV 4K HD","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe MOXOM MX-AX29 functional cable \/ adapter is the optimal addition for those who want to connect their compatible gadget to a projector or external monitor via an HDMI port. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eYou can connect an additional monitor to your laptop or Mac Book. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eYou do not need to install additional drivers to use it - you just need to connect it to the appropriate Type-C and HDMI jacks! \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e-Accessory: Adapter \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e-Interface: HDMI to Type-C \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e-Length: 1.8m \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e-Colour: Black\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e-Max Resolution: 4K\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e-Size: 180cm +-5cm\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"MOXOM","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47933621666014,"sku":null,"price":15.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/trpr-175894-106816.jpg?v=1772028673"},{"product_id":"gopro-hero-13-black","title":"GoPro Hero 13 Black Premium Action Camera","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"GoPro HERO13 Black + HB-Series Lens Collection\" src=\"https:\/\/media.foto-erhardt.de\/images\/product_images\/thumbnail_images\/020\/gopro-hero13-black-hb-series-lens-collection-17508337902090304.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHERO13 Black boosts your creative possibilities with the HB-Series Lenses with Auto-Detect, plus compatibility with Magnetic Latch Mounting and all-new ways to extend battery power. It also features a new body design (it still fits the same HERO12 Black Protective Case and Media Mod), a new battery and battery connection points, GPS and data overlay, Burst Slo-Mo (up to 400fps at 720p), 10-bit HLG HDR, and Wi-Fi6.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe HERO Black Series Lenses are a suite of interchangeable lenses let you instantly set up your camera for a variety of specialty shots. HERO13 Black detects when a lens or filter is attached and automatically adjusts its settings accordingly. The suite includes Macro Lens Mod, Ultra Wide Lens Mod, Smart Motion Blur ND Filter 4-Pack, and Anamorphic Lens Mod. NOTE: All lenses sold separately.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe new Enduro Battery for HERO13 Black is a higher-capacity, 1900mAh battery (compared to the previous 1720mAh) that gives you longer runtimes in all conditions, from hot to freezing. It provides more than 2.5 hours of continuous recording at 1080p30 or over 1.5 hours at 4K30 and 5.3K30. NOTE: Enduro for HERO13 Black is not compatible with older GoPros.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHERO13 Black is compatible with Magnetic Latch Mounts. There are magnets near the camera’s built-in fingers that align with Magnetic Latch Mounts (sold separately) making it fast and easy to click your favorite mounts into place — and they release with a quick pinch.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cheader class=\"GoPro_Dialog_header Dialog_dialogHeader__TNWXH\"\u003e\n\u003ch1 class=\"GoPro_Dialog_headText\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/media.foto-erhardt.de\/images\/product_images\/original_images\/646\/gopro-hero13-black-hb-series-lens-collection-175083392964630304.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eTop-Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVideos with 5.3K60 and 4K120 and still images with up to 24.7 MP\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWaterproof up to 10 meters\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHyperSmooth video stabilization\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBuilt-in GPS sensor\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNew battery with more power for more recording fun\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHLG HDR videos\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSlo-Mo recording even slower 13x slow motion in 720p400 for 15 sec.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWLAN 6 technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"GoPro_Dialog_headText\"\u003eEverything In The Box\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"GoPro_Dialog_headText\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cimg srcset=\"https:\/\/static.gopro.com\/assets\/blta2b8522e5372af40\/blt6bd610920853b735\/66b532939519f0b23372976e\/01-in-box-h13-accessories-standalone.png?width=375\u0026amp;quality=80\u0026amp;auto=webp\u0026amp;disable=upscale 375w, https:\/\/static.gopro.com\/assets\/blta2b8522e5372af40\/blt6bd610920853b735\/66b532939519f0b23372976e\/01-in-box-h13-accessories-standalone.png?width=750\u0026amp;quality=80\u0026amp;auto=webp\u0026amp;disable=upscale 750w, https:\/\/static.gopro.com\/assets\/blta2b8522e5372af40\/blt6bd610920853b735\/66b532939519f0b23372976e\/01-in-box-h13-accessories-standalone.png?width=768\u0026amp;quality=80\u0026amp;auto=webp\u0026amp;disable=upscale 768w, https:\/\/static.gopro.com\/assets\/blta2b8522e5372af40\/blt6bd610920853b735\/66b532939519f0b23372976e\/01-in-box-h13-accessories-standalone.png?width=1024\u0026amp;quality=80\u0026amp;auto=webp\u0026amp;disable=upscale 1024w, https:\/\/static.gopro.com\/assets\/blta2b8522e5372af40\/blt6bd610920853b735\/66b532939519f0b23372976e\/01-in-box-h13-accessories-standalone.png?width=1280\u0026amp;quality=80\u0026amp;auto=webp\u0026amp;disable=upscale 1280w, https:\/\/static.gopro.com\/assets\/blta2b8522e5372af40\/blt6bd610920853b735\/66b532939519f0b23372976e\/01-in-box-h13-accessories-standalone.png?width=1536\u0026amp;quality=80\u0026amp;auto=webp\u0026amp;disable=upscale 1536w, https:\/\/static.gopro.com\/assets\/blta2b8522e5372af40\/blt6bd610920853b735\/66b532939519f0b23372976e\/01-in-box-h13-accessories-standalone.png?width=1920\u0026amp;quality=80\u0026amp;auto=webp\u0026amp;disable=upscale 1920w, https:\/\/static.gopro.com\/assets\/blta2b8522e5372af40\/blt6bd610920853b735\/66b532939519f0b23372976e\/01-in-box-h13-accessories-standalone.png?width=2048\u0026amp;quality=80\u0026amp;auto=webp\u0026amp;disable=upscale 2048w, https:\/\/static.gopro.com\/assets\/blta2b8522e5372af40\/blt6bd610920853b735\/66b532939519f0b23372976e\/01-in-box-h13-accessories-standalone.png?width=2880\u0026amp;quality=80\u0026amp;auto=webp\u0026amp;disable=upscale 2880w, https:\/\/static.gopro.com\/assets\/blta2b8522e5372af40\/blt6bd610920853b735\/66b532939519f0b23372976e\/01-in-box-h13-accessories-standalone.png?width=3840\u0026amp;quality=80\u0026amp;auto=webp\u0026amp;disable=upscale 3840w\" sizes=\"100vw\" src=\"https:\/\/static.gopro.com\/assets\/blta2b8522e5372af40\/blt6bd610920853b735\/66b532939519f0b23372976e\/01-in-box-h13-accessories-standalone.png?width=3840\u0026amp;quality=80\u0026amp;auto=webp\u0026amp;disable=upscale\" class=\"GPImage_imageLoaded__XIyZu\" data-nimg=\"fill\" decoding=\"async\" draggable=\"false\" alt=\"HERO13 Black Camera\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"GoPro_Dialog_headText\"\u003eHERO13 Black Camera\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cimg srcset=\"https:\/\/static.gopro.com\/assets\/blta2b8522e5372af40\/bltd2a6d77fda01f8f0\/66b532de0d26b21691e48213\/03-in-box-h13-accessories-enduro.png?width=375\u0026amp;quality=80\u0026amp;auto=webp\u0026amp;disable=upscale 375w, https:\/\/static.gopro.com\/assets\/blta2b8522e5372af40\/bltd2a6d77fda01f8f0\/66b532de0d26b21691e48213\/03-in-box-h13-accessories-enduro.png?width=750\u0026amp;quality=80\u0026amp;auto=webp\u0